hat","新聊天"],["api","API"],["customEndpoint","自訂端點"],["apiEndpoint.inputLabel","API端點輸入標籤"],["apiKey.inputLabel","apiKey.inputLabel"],["apiVersion.inputLabel","apiVersion.inputLabel"],["apiVersion.description","apiVersion.description"],["securityMessage","securityMessage"],["apiEndpoint.description","apiEndpoint.description"],["apiEndpoint.warn","apiEndpoint.warn"],["partialImportMessages","partialImportMessages"],["import","import"],["name","name"],["prompt","prompt"],["clearPrompts","clearPrompts"],["morePrompts","morePrompts"],["toast.sync","toast.sync"],["toast.stop","toast.stop"],["button.sync","button.sync"],["button.stop","button.stop"]],"context":[["tid/100988/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/100993/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/461961/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/553437/type/StringLiteral","tid/622216/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/553469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/557612/type/StringLiteral","tid/557632/type/StringLiteral","tid/557654/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/560505/type/StringLiteral","tid/560543/type/StringLiteral","tid/560586/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606465/type/StringLiteral","tid/606538/type/StringLiteral","tid/606579/type/StringLiteral","tid/606677/type/StringLiteral","tid/606756/type/StringLiteral","tid/606782/type/StringLiteral","tid/606903/type/StringLiteral","tid/606925/type/StringLiteral","tid/606947/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606533/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606574/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606672/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606751/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606898/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/608789/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/608794/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622327/type/StringLiteral","tid/630226/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622664/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622687/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629607/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629731/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629782/type/StringLiteral","tid/629789/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629815/type/StringLiteral","tid/629822/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"index-b6a300c4.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi/BetterChatGPT/dist/assets","extension":".js","filename":"index-b6a300c4.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/BetterChatGPT/dist/assets/index-b6a300c4.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"customModels.customLabel":0,"model":1,"|":2,"promptLibrary":3,"search":4,"downloadChat":5,"newChat":6,"api":7,"customEndpoint":8,"apiEndpoint.inputLabel":9,"apiKey.inputLabel":10,"apiVersion.inputLabel":11,"apiVersion.description":12,"securityMessage":13,"apiEndpoint.description":14,"apiEndpoint.warn":15,"partialImportMessages":16,"import":17,"name":18,"prompt":19,"clearPrompts":20,"morePrompts":21,"toast.sync":22,"toast.stop":23,"button.sync":24,"button.stop":25},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/BetterChatGPT/dist/assets/index-b6a300c4.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":26,"length":26,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/batchAPI.js":{"data":[["Translate with ChatGPT Batch API","Translate with ChatGPT Batch API"],["Model","Model"],["The pre-trained model.","The pre-trained model."],["It seems that the OpenAI Batch API uses a slightly different model naming convention than the generally used API. Models used in the Batch API have a “-batch” prefix. For example, if you use <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>, the model automatically becomes <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>.<br />\nHowever, as of the time this add-on was created, batch models are not listed in OpenAI's model usage limits, which makes it impossible for users to use the Batch API if they've set the Model Usage filter to “Allow” (whitelist).<br />\nThis is likely a bug in the OpenAI UI that may be fixed in the future.<br />\nSo, make sure to set the usage limits in OpenAI to “Block” (blacklist) mode in order to use the Batch API.<br />\nClick here to change the model's usage limits: https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\n","It seems that the OpenAI Batch API uses a slightly different model naming convention than the generally used API. Models used in the Batch API have a “-batch” prefix. For example, if you use <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>, the model automatically becomes <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>.<br />\nHowever, as of the time this add-on was created, batch models are not listed in OpenAI's model usage limits, which makes it impossible for users to use the Batch API if they've set the Model Usage filter to “Allow” (whitelist).<br />\nThis is likely a bug in the OpenAI UI that may be fixed in the future.<br />\nSo, make sure to set the usage limits in OpenAI to “Block” (blacklist) mode in order to use the Batch API.<br />\nClick here to change the model's usage limits: https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\n"],["Source Column","來源欄"],["The column of the original texts you want to translate.","您想要翻譯的原始文本所在欄位。"],["Add actor name","添加演員名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","從行資訊中附加演員名稱到可翻譯文本中。這將幫助翻譯者追蹤對話和代名詞。Translator++ 隨後會從翻譯結果中移除演員名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Ignore if already translated","若已翻譯則忽略"],["If this option is checked then Translator++ will ignore any row that already has translations on its column.","如果勾選此選項，Translator++ 將忽略任何在其欄位中已有翻譯的行。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入演員參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾選，Translator++ 將載入演員參考作為詞彙表。這將幫助翻譯者理解對話的上下文。演員參考是對話中演員的名稱。這將作為詞彙表載入到翻譯者中，會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","只有對話中存在的角色才會作為每個批次項目的詞彙表載入。使用模板命令在提示訊息中載入演員參考。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","演員參考翻譯欄"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","演員名稱翻譯的欄位。此欄位將用作演員參考的翻譯，以提高對話中演員名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","演員資訊欄"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含演員額外資訊的欄位。您可以放入更多資訊，如性別、年齡等，這將改善對話中代名詞的翻譯。"],["System Message Template","系統訊息模板"],["System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.","系統訊息是訊息的標頭，將告知您的 chatGPT 助手的角色。此訊息將作為每個發送給 chatGPT 的批次的第一條訊息發送。"],["You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>","您可以使用 JavaScript 模板字面值樣式包含以下變數 <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>"],["Variables:<br>","變數：<br>"],["<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>","<li>LANG_FROM : 來源語言</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>","<li>LANG_TO : 目標語言</li>"],["<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>","<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : 完整來源語言名稱</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>","<li>LANG_TO_FULL : 完整目標語言名稱</li>"],["<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>","<li>SOURCE_TEXT : 源文本</li>"],["<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>","<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : 預定義的轉義算法訊息。</li>"],["<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>","<li>NEWLINE_STRING : 表示換行的字符串（行替代）。</li>"],["<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>","<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : 批次中的訊息數量。</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 添加角色的資訊。</li>"],["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[object name] : 從 Translator++ 物件生成參考。<br />範例：<code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Include some previous lines as a context</li>","<li>CONTEXT : 包含一些前幾行作為上下文</li>"],["Body Message Template","主體訊息模板"],["Template of the body of your chat.","聊天主體的模板。"],["Sample conversation","範例對話"],["The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.","ChatGPT 批次 API 允許您以 50% 更低的成本異步翻譯您的項目，這意味著您將在<b style=\"color:red\">24 小時內</b>以<b style=\"color:red\">正常成本的一半</b>收到翻譯結果。這對於不需要立即翻譯結果的大型項目特別有用。"],[" <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch ."," <br />閱讀更多關於 ChatGPT 批次 API 的資訊：https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch 。"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["This form is using your existing ChatGPT configuration.<br>","此表單使用您現有的 ChatGPT 配置。<br>"],["You can change the configuration by going to the ChatGPT Translator settings in the options window.<br>","您可以通過前往選項窗口中的 ChatGPT 翻譯器設定來更改配置。<br>"],["There you can set the API key, model, and other settings.<br />","在那裡您可以設置 API 金鑰、模型和其他設定。<br />"],["<input type=\"button\" href=\"#\" onclick='ui.openOptionsWindow({focus: {menu: \"chatGPT\",find: \"Your OpenAI API Key\"}});' value=\"Open ChatGPT settings\" />","<input type=\"button\" href=\"#\" onclick='ui.openOptionsWindow({focus: {menu: \"chatGPT\",find: \"Your OpenAI API Key\"}});' value=\"開啟 ChatGPT 設定\" />"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將角色名稱附加至可翻譯文本"],["Ignore translated rows","忽略已翻譯行"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表加入提示中。詞彙表會為每批項目加載，以提升翻譯品質。功能會嘗試僅加載相關術語，避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","角色附加資訊欄"],["Prompt Template","提示模板"],["<h2>1. System Message</h2>","<h2>1. 系統訊息</h2>"],["<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>","<p>您可以在這裡向助手解釋他們的角色。</p>"],["<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>2. 樣本對話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>現有對話樣本。您可以撰寫良好或不良回應的樣本，以幫助翻譯者理解您的目標和對話上下文。</p>"],["<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>","<h2>3. 您的實際提示</h2>"],["<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>","<p>這是發送給助手的實際提示。</p>"],["<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.","<h3>間接成本</h3>\n                        間接成本是您發送給助手而不包含實際翻譯文本的提示訊息成本。成本基於提示訊息中的令牌數量計算。令牌越多，成本越高。<br>\n                        <b>當前間接成本：</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> 令牌 / 請求。"],["Are you sure you want to reset the form?","您確定要重置表單嗎？"],["Are you sure you want to process the batch?\nCost will be incurred for this operation.","您確定要處理批次嗎？\n此操作將產生成本。"],["The batch is successfully created. Do you want to open the batch manager?","批次已成功創建。您要開啟批次管理器嗎？"],["OpenAI Batch API Queue","OpenAI 批次 API 隊列"]],"context":[["tid/206/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/283/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/293/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/302/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/349/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/376/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/386/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/421/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/431/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/494/type/StringLiteral","tid/1400/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/504/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/511/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/545/type/StringLiteral","tid/1431/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/555/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/582/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/592/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/698/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/708/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/716/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/724/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/737/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/745/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/753/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/761/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/769/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/785/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/793/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/801/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/809/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/817/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/825/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/833/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/872/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/882/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/928/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1023/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1035/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1059/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1085/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1093/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1100/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1107/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1268/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1292/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1370/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1377/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1462/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1530/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1556/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1563/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1608/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1615/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1741/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1802/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2019/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5713/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6421/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"batchAPI.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi","extension":".js","filename":"batchAPI.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/batchAPI.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Translate with ChatGPT Batch API":0,"Model":1,"The pre-trained model.":2,"It seems that the OpenAI Batch API uses a slightly different model naming convention than the generally used API. Models used in the Batch API have a “-batch” prefix. For example, if you use <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>, the model automatically becomes <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>.<br />\nHowever, as of the time this add-on was created, batch models are not listed in OpenAI's model usage limits, which makes it impossible for users to use the Batch API if they've set the Model Usage filter to “Allow” (whitelist).<br />\nThis is likely a bug in the OpenAI UI that may be fixed in the future.<br />\nSo, make sure to set the usage limits in OpenAI to “Block” (blacklist) mode in order to use the Batch API.<br />\nClick here to change the model's usage limits: https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\n":3,"Source Column":4,"The column of the original texts you want to translate.":5,"Add actor name":6,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":7,"Ignore if already translated":8,"If this option is checked then Translator++ will ignore any row that already has translations on its column.":9,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":10,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":11,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":12,"Actor Reference Translation Column":13,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":14,"Actor's Information Column":15,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":16,"System Message Template":17,"System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.":18,"You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>":19,"Variables:<br>":20,"<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>":21,"<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>":22,"<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>":23,"<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>":24,"<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>":25,"<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>":26,"<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>":27,"<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>":28,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>":29,"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":30,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":31,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":32,"<li>CONTEXT : Include some previous lines as a context</li>":33,"Body Message Template":34,"Template of the body of your chat.":35,"Sample conversation":36,"The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.":37," <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch .":38,"General Settings":39,"This form is using your existing ChatGPT configuration.<br>":40,"You can change the configuration by going to the ChatGPT Translator settings in the options window.<br>":41,"There you can set the API key, model, and other settings.<br />":42,"<input type=\"button\" href=\"#\" onclick='ui.openOptionsWindow({focus: {menu: \"chatGPT\",find: \"Your OpenAI API Key\"}});' value=\"Open ChatGPT settings\" />":43,"Append actor name to the translatable text":44,"Ignore translated rows":45,"Glossary":46,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":47,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":48,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":49,"Prompt Template":50,"<h2>1. System Message</h2>":51,"<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>":52,"<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>":53,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":54,"<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>":55,"<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>":56,"<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.":57,"Are you sure you want to reset the form?":58,"Are you sure you want to process the batch?\nCost will be incurred for this operation.":59,"The batch is successfully created. Do you want to open the batch manager?":60,"OpenAI Batch API Queue":61},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/batchAPI.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":62,"length":62,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatGPT-legacy.js":{"data":[["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[物件名稱] : 從 Translator++ 物件生成參考。<br />範例 : <code>REFERENCE[通用參考]</code></li>"]],"context":[["tid/540/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/548/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/556/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"chatGPT-legacy.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi","extension":".js","filename":"chatGPT-legacy.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatGPT-legacy.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":0,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":1,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":2},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatGPT-legacy.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":3,"length":3,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js":{"data":[["Please select the rows to apply the translation","請選擇要套用翻譯的行"],["Target Column","目標欄位"],["The column to put the translation result.","放置翻譯結果的欄位。"],["Import translation from ChatGPT Batch","從ChatGPT批次導入翻譯"],["Translation applied to selected rows","翻譯已套用至選取的行"],["Invalid format","格式無效"],["OK","確定"],["Mismatch","不匹配"],["Failed to load batch list with error: \n","加載批次列表失敗，錯誤：\n"],["Download Error File","下載錯誤檔案"],["Batch is not completed yet","批次尚未完成"],["Are you sure you want to cancel this batch?","您確定要取消此批次嗎？"],["Cannot cancel completed batch.","無法取消已完成的批次。"],["Batch cancelled","批次已取消"],["Failed to cancel batch","取消批次失敗"]],"context":[["tid/1722/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1767/type/StringLiteral","tid/11130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1777/type/StringLiteral","tid/11140/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1851/type/StringLiteral","tid/11214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2191/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2621/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2653/type/StringLiteral","tid/2732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2700/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6512/type/StringLiteral","tid/6773/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8735/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11078/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12952/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/13030/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/13088/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/13105/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"chatgpt-batch-manager.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatgpt-batch-manager","extension":".js","filename":"chatgpt-batch-manager.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Please select the rows to apply the translation":0,"Target Column":1,"The column to put the translation result.":2,"Import translation from ChatGPT Batch":3,"Translation applied to selected rows":4,"Invalid format":5,"OK":6,"Mismatch":7,"Failed to load batch list with error: \n":8,"Download Error File":9,"Batch is not completed yet":10,"Are you sure you want to cancel this batch?":11,"Cannot cancel completed batch.":12,"Batch cancelled":13,"Failed to cancel batch":14},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":15,"length":15,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html":{"data":[["Batches","批次"],["Apply translation","應用翻譯"],["Cancel batch","取消批次"],["Status","狀態"],["Batch ID","批次ID"],["Input File ID","輸入檔案ID"],["End point","端點"],["Created at","建立於"],["Expires at <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.\"></i>","到期於 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"未及時完成的批次最終會進入過期狀態；該批次中未完成的請求將被取消，而對已完成請求的回應可透過批次的輸出檔案取得。您將被收取任何已完成請求所消耗的令牌費用。\"></i>"],["Completed at","完成於"],["Errors","錯誤"],["Batch Item Detail of","批次項目詳細資訊"],["ID","ID"],["Completed on","完成於"],["Model","模型"],["Prompt Token","提示令牌"],["Completion Token","完成令牌"],["Total Token","總令牌數"],["Status Code","狀態碼"],["error","錯誤"],["Conversation","對話"],["Response Validation","回應驗證"],["Raw Payload","原始負載"],["View raw payload","查看原始負載"],["Response Preview","回應預覽"],["Apply translations from selected rows","從選取的行套用翻譯"],["Here you can edit the translation result individually and send it into Translator++","在此您可以個別編輯翻譯結果並發送至 Translator++"],["Open ChatGPT Settings","開啟 ChatGPT 設定"],["Help","說明"],["File list","檔案清單"],["Collapse / restore left panel","收合/還原左側面板"],["Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.","未及時完成的批次最終會進入過期狀態；該批次中未完成的請求將被取消，而對已完成請求的回應將透過批次的輸出檔案提供。您將被收取已完成請求所消耗的代幣費用。"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/2/innerText","idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/3/innerText","idx/9/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"]],"basename":"index.html","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatgpt-batch-manager","extension":".html","filename":"index.html","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Batches":0,"Apply translation":1,"Cancel batch":2,"Status":3,"Batch ID":4,"Input File ID":5,"End point":6,"Created at":7,"Expires at <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.\"></i>":8,"Completed at":9,"Errors":10,"Batch Item Detail of":11,"ID":12,"Completed on":13,"Model":14,"Prompt Token":15,"Completion Token":16,"Total Token":17,"Status Code":18,"error":19,"Conversation":20,"Response Validation":21,"Raw Payload":22,"View raw payload":23,"Response Preview":24,"Apply translations from selected rows":25,"Here you can edit the translation result individually and send it into Translator++":26,"Open ChatGPT Settings":27,"Help":28,"File list":29,"Collapse / restore left panel":30,"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.":31},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":32,"length":32,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/options.js":{"data":[["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 角色資訊詞彙表。（僅在批次模式中啟用角色資訊選項時）</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[物件名稱] : 從 Translator++ 物件生成參考。<br />範例 : <code>REFERENCE[通用參考]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>","<li>CONTEXT : 先前翻譯的上下文（如果啟用了上下文）</li>"],["Sample conversation","範例對話"],["<h2>Don't waste your money on Reasoning Models</h2>","<h2>別浪費錢在推理模型上</h2>"],["<p>It has been proven by various studies that reasoning models are far worse than the normal models on performing creative writings and translation tasks.</p>","<p>多項研究已證明，推理模型在創意寫作和翻譯任務上的表現遠不如普通模型。</p>"],["<p>You gain nothing but more expensive cost and slower response times when using reasoning models.</p>","<p>使用推理模型只會帶來更昂貴的成本和更慢的回應時間，一無所獲。</p>"],["<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>範例對話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>現有對話範例。您可以撰寫好或壞回應的範例，以幫助翻譯者理解您的目標和對話上下文。</p>"],["Always separate file","總是分開檔案"],["Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.","總是為每個批次分開檔案。這可以保持每個檔案的上下文不受其他檔案污染。"],["Add actor name","添加角色名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","從行資訊附加角色名稱到可翻譯文本中。這將幫助翻譯者追蹤對話和代名詞。Translator++ 隨後會從翻譯結果中移除角色名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入角色參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾選，Translator++ 將載入角色參考作為詞彙表。這將幫助翻譯者理解對話的上下文。角色參考是對話中角色的名稱。這將作為詞彙表載入到翻譯者中。這會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","只有對話中存在的角色才會被載入為每個批次項目的詞彙表。使用模板命令在提示訊息中載入角色參考。"],["<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.","<br />⚠️如果您啟用此選項，還需要在提示模板中包含 <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> 變數來放置角色資訊數據。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色參考翻譯欄"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名稱翻譯的欄位。此欄位將用作角色參考的翻譯，以提高對話中角色名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","角色資訊欄"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含角色額外資訊的欄位。您可以放置更多資訊，如性別、年齡等，這將改善對話中代詞的翻譯。"],["Extra Prompt","額外提示"],["Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.","將添加到提示訊息中的額外提示。這將在系統訊息之後、實際提示訊息之前添加。"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["Always separate file for each batch","始終為每個批次使用單獨的檔案"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將角色名稱附加到可翻譯文本"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表添加到提示中。詞彙表將為每個項目批次加載，以提高翻譯質量。該功能將嘗試僅加載相關術語，以避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","角色額外資訊的欄位"],["Prompt","提示"]],"context":[["tid/727/type/StringLiteral","tid/5390/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/735/type/StringLiteral","tid/5398/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/743/type/StringLiteral","tid/5406/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/751/type/StringLiteral","tid/5414/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/759/type/StringLiteral","tid/5422/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2367/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2375/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2383/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2907/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2914/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5098/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5108/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5142/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5152/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5189/type/StringLiteral","tid/5599/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5199/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5206/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5213/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5247/type/StringLiteral","tid/5630/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5257/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5284/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5294/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5324/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5334/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5487/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5511/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5543/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5569/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5576/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5661/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5692/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"options.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi","extension":".js","filename":"options.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/options.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":0,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":1,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>":2,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":3,"<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>":4,"Sample conversation":5,"<h2>Don't waste your money on Reasoning Models</h2>":6,"<p>It has been proven by various studies that reasoning models are far worse than the normal models on performing creative writings and translation tasks.</p>":7,"<p>You gain nothing but more expensive cost and slower response times when using reasoning models.</p>":8,"<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>":9,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":10,"Always separate file":11,"Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.":12,"Add actor name":13,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":14,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":15,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":16,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":17,"<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.":18,"Actor Reference Translation Column":19,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":20,"Actor's Information Column":21,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":22,"Extra Prompt":23,"Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.":24,"General Settings":25,"Always separate file for each batch":26,"Append actor name to the translatable text":27,"Glossary":28,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":29,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":30,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":31,"Prompt":32},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/options.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":33,"length":33,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/tester/chatGPTtester.html":{"data":[["<u>S</u>end","<u>發</u>送"],["Toggle word wrap","切換自動換行"],["Open debugger (F12)","開啟偵錯工具 (F12)"],["Help","說明"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"]],"basename":"chatGPTtester.html","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi/tester","extension":".html","filename":"chatGPTtester.html","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/tester/chatGPTtester.html","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<u>S</u>end":0,"Toggle word wrap":1,"Open debugger (F12)":2,"Help":3},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/tester/chatGPTtester.html","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":4,"length":4,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/tester/chatGPTtester.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.","此功能僅在您使用 Translator++ 開發者版本時可用。您可以透過基本工具 -> 變更核心 NWJS 切換至開發者版本。"]],"context":[["tid/1692/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"chatGPTtester.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi/tester","extension":".js","filename":"chatGPTtester.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/tester/chatGPTtester.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.":0},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/tester/chatGPTtester.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":1,"length":1,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/transOpenAIAssistant.js":{"data":[["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 角色資訊詞彙表（僅在批次模式中啟用角色資訊選項時）</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[object name] : 從Translator++物件生成參考。<br />例如：<code>REFERENCE[通用參考]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>","<li>CONTEXT : 先前翻譯的上下文（如果啟用上下文）</li>"],["Sample conversation","樣本對話"],["<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>範例對話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>現有對話範例。您可以撰寫良好或不良回應的樣本，以幫助翻譯者理解您的目標和對話的上下文。</p>"],["Always separate file","始終分開檔案"],["Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.","始終為每個批次分開檔案。這可以保持每個檔案的上下文不受其他檔案污染。"],["Add actor name","添加角色名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","從行信息中附加角色名稱到可翻譯文本。這將幫助翻譯者追蹤對話和代詞。Translator++ 隨後會從翻譯結果中移除角色名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入角色參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾選，Translator++ 將載入角色參考作為詞彙表。這將幫助翻譯者理解對話的上下文。角色參考是對話中角色的名稱。這將作為詞彙表載入到翻譯者。這會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","只有對話中存在的角色才會作為每個批次項目的詞彙表載入。使用模板命令在提示消息中載入角色參考。"],["<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.","<br />⚠️如果您啟用此選項，還需要在提示模板中包含 <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> 變量來放置角色信息數據。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色參考翻譯列"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名稱翻譯的列。此列將用作角色參考的翻譯。這將提高對話中角色名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","角色信息列"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含角色附加信息的列。您可以放入更多信息，如性別、年齡等。這將改善對話中代詞的翻譯。"],["Extra Prompt","額外提示"],["Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.","將添加到提示消息中的額外提示。這將在系統消息之後、實際提示消息之前添加。"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["Always separate file for each batch","始終為每個批次分開檔案"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將角色名稱附加到可翻譯文本"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表加入提示中。詞彙表會為每批項目加載，以提高翻譯品質。此功能會嘗試僅加載相關術語，以避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","演員附加資訊欄位"],["Prompt","提示"]],"context":[["tid/778/type/StringLiteral","tid/4939/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/786/type/StringLiteral","tid/4947/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/794/type/StringLiteral","tid/4955/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/802/type/StringLiteral","tid/4963/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/810/type/StringLiteral","tid/4971/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/879/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2626/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2633/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4657/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4691/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4701/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4738/type/StringLiteral","tid/5148/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4762/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4796/type/StringLiteral","tid/5179/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4806/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4833/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4843/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4873/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4883/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5010/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5036/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5060/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5092/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5118/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5125/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5210/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5241/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"transOpenAIAssistant.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi","extension":".js","filename":"transOpenAIAssistant.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/transOpenAIAssistant.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":0,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":1,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>":2,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":3,"<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>":4,"Sample conversation":5,"<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>":6,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":7,"Always separate file":8,"Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.":9,"Add actor name":10,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":11,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":12,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":13,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":14,"<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.":15,"Actor Reference Translation Column":16,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":17,"Actor's Information Column":18,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":19,"Extra Prompt":20,"Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.":21,"General Settings":22,"Always separate file for each batch":23,"Append actor name to the translatable text":24,"Glossary":25,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":26,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":27,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":28,"Prompt":29},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/transOpenAIAssistant.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":30,"length":30,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiAi/utility.js":{"data":[["Chat with ChatGPT API","與ChatGPT API聊天"],["Batch Manager","批次管理器"],["This feature is only available if you have a project open.","此功能僅在您有開啟專案時可用。"]],"context":[["tid/500/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/596/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/632/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"utility.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiAi","extension":".js","filename":"utility.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiAi/utility.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Chat with ChatGPT API":0,"Batch Manager":1,"This feature is only available if you have a project open.":2},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiAi/utility.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":3,"length":3,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transGeminiNano/geminiNanoUtils.js":{"data":[["This action will launch a browser window. Make sure your default browser is set to Chrome browser. Do you want to continue?","此操作將啟動瀏覽器視窗。請確保您的預設瀏覽器設為 Chrome 瀏覽器。您要繼續嗎？"],["Gemini Nano server is already running. Do you want to restart it?","Gemini Nano 伺服器已在運行中。您要重新啟動它嗎？"],["This action will launch a browser window. Make sure your default browser is set to Chrome browser. And Gemini Nano Server is starte. Do you want to continue?","此操作將啟動瀏覽器視窗。請確保您的預設瀏覽器已設為 Chrome 瀏覽器。且 Gemini Nano 伺服器已啟動。您要繼續嗎？"]],"context":[["tid/1312/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1352/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1525/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"geminiNanoUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/transGeminiNano","extension":".js","filename":"geminiNanoUtils.js","path":"/addons/transGeminiNano/geminiNanoUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"This action will launch a browser window. Make sure your default browser is set to Chrome browser. Do you want to continue?":0,"Gemini Nano server is already running. Do you want to restart it?":1,"This action will launch a browser window. Make sure your default browser is set to Chrome browser. And Gemini Nano Server is starte. Do you want to continue?":2},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transGeminiNano/geminiNanoUtils.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":3,"length":3,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transKoboldAI/Llama3.js":{"data":[["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 角色資訊詞彙表。（僅在批次模式中啟用角色資訊選項時）</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[物件名稱] : 從 Translator++ 物件生成參考。<br />範例：<code>REFERENCE[通用參考]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>","<li>CONTEXT : 先前翻譯的上下文（如果啟用上下文）</li>"],["Always separate file","始終分開檔案"],["Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.","始終為每個批次分開檔案。這可以保持每個檔案的上下文不受其他檔案污染。"],["Add actor name","添加角色名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","從行資訊中附加角色名稱到可翻譯文本。這將幫助翻譯者追蹤對話和代名詞。Translator++ 隨後會從翻譯結果中移除角色名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入角色參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾選，Translator++ 將載入角色參考作為詞彙表。這將幫助翻譯者理解對話的上下文。角色參考是對話中角色的名稱。這將作為詞彙表載入到翻譯器中。這會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","僅存在於對話中的角色將被載入為每個批次項目的詞彙表。使用模板命令在提示訊息中載入角色參考。"],["<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.","<br />⚠️如果您啟用此選項，還需要在提示模板中包含 <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> 變數來放置角色資訊數據。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色參考翻譯欄位"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名稱翻譯的欄位。此欄位將用作角色參考的翻譯。這將提高對話中角色名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","角色資訊欄位"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含角色額外資訊的欄位。您可以放入更多資訊，如性別、年齡等。這將改善對話中代名詞的翻譯。"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["Always separate file for each batch","每個批次始終使用單獨的檔案"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將角色名稱附加到可翻譯文本"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表添加到提示中。詞彙表將為每個批次項目加載，以提高翻譯質量。該功能將嘗試僅加載相關術語，以避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","角色附加資訊的欄位"]],"context":[["tid/820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/844/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/852/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3346/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3356/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3390/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3400/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3437/type/StringLiteral","tid/3715/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3447/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3454/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3495/type/StringLiteral","tid/3746/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3505/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3532/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3577/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3603/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3627/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3659/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3692/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3777/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"Llama3.js","dirname":"/addons/transKoboldAI","extension":".js","filename":"Llama3.js","path":"/addons/transKoboldAI/Llama3.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":0,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":1,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>":2,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":3,"<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>":4,"Always separate file":5,"Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.":6,"Add actor name":7,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":8,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":9,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":10,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":11,"<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.":12,"Actor Reference Translation Column":13,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":14,"Actor's Information Column":15,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":16,"General Settings":17,"Always separate file for each batch":18,"Append actor name to the translatable text":19,"Glossary":20,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":21,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":22,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":23},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transKoboldAI/Llama3.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":24,"length":24,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/batchAPI.js":{"data":[["Service Name","服務名稱"],["Service provider for your Batch API.","您的批次API的服務提供商。"],["Your API Key","您的API金鑰"],["Please enter your API key for the Batch API service.","請輸入您的批次API服務的API金鑰。"],["Model","模型"],["The model for your translation.","用於翻譯的模型。"],["Source Column","來源欄位"],["The column of the original texts you want to translate.","您想要翻譯的原始文本的欄位。"],["Add actor name","添加角色名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","從行資訊中將角色名稱附加到可翻譯文本。這將幫助譯者跟蹤對話和代詞。Translator++隨後會從翻譯結果中移除角色名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Ignore if already translated","如果已翻譯則忽略"],["If this option is checked then Translator++ will ignore any row that already has translations on its column.","如果勾選此選項，則Translator++將忽略任何在其欄位中已有翻譯的行。"],["Filter Tag","篩選標籤"],["If set, only rows with this tag will be translated.","如果設置，則僅翻譯帶有此標籤的行。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入角色參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","若勾選，Translator++ 將載入角色參考作為詞彙表。這有助於翻譯者理解對話的上下文。角色參考是對話中角色的名稱，將作為詞彙表載入給翻譯者使用，但會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","僅對話中存在的角色會作為每個批次項目的詞彙表載入。使用模板指令在提示訊息中載入角色參考。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色參考翻譯欄位"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名稱翻譯的欄位。此欄位將用作角色參考的翻譯，有助於提升對話中角色名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","角色資訊欄位"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含角色額外資訊的欄位。您可以輸入性別、年齡等更多資訊，這將改善對話中代名詞的翻譯。"],["Enable Context","啟用上下文"],["Enable context for the translation. The previously translated material above the current batch will be included as a context. <b>You also need to explicitly includes the CONTEXT into the template</b>","啟用翻譯的上下文。當前批次上方已翻譯的內容將作為上下文包含。 <b>您還需要在模板中明確包含 CONTEXT</b>"],["Context Character Limit","上下文字元限制"],["Character limit for the context.","上下文的字元限制。"],["System Message Template","系統訊息模板"],["System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.","系統訊息是訊息標頭，用於告知您的 ChatGPT 助理的角色。此訊息將作為每個發送給 ChatGPT 的批次的第一條訊息。"],["You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>","您可以使用 JavaScript 模板字面量風格包含以下變數 <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>"],["Variables:<br>","變數：<br>"],["<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>","<li>LANG_FROM : 源語言</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>","<li>LANG_TO : 目標語言</li>"],["<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>","<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : 完整的源語言名稱</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>","<li>LANG_TO_FULL : 完整的目標語言名稱</li>"],["<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>","<li>SOURCE_TEXT : 源文本</li>"],["<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>","<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : 預定義的逃逸算法訊息。</li>"],["<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>","<li>NEWLINE_STRING : 表示新行的字串（行替代）。</li>"],["<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>","<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : 批次中的訊息數量。</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 添加演員的資訊。</li>"],["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[物件名稱] : 從 Translator++ 物件生成參考。<br />範例：<code>REFERENCE[通用參考]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Include some previous lines as a context</li>","<li>CONTEXT : 包含一些前幾行作為上下文</li>"],["Body Message Template","主體訊息模板"],["Template of the body of your chat.","您聊天主體的模板。"],["Sample conversation","範例對話"],["User message","使用者訊息"],["Assistant's response","助理的回應"],["Enable JailBreak","啟用 JailBreak"],["Enable Jailbreak for the translation. This will make the translation more accurate and less biased. Some models may want to relate fictional events to real life events, hence they will try to alter the translation to fit their own narrative. This option will prevent that.","啟用 Jailbreak 以進行翻譯。這將使翻譯更準確且偏見更少。某些模型可能希望將虛構事件與現實生活事件聯繫起來，因此它們會嘗試更改翻譯以符合自己的敘述。此選項將防止這種情況。"],["Jailbreak Template","Jailbreak 模板"],["Template of the Jailbreak message.","Jailbreak 訊息的模板。"],["Maximum Tokens","最大令牌數"],["The maximum number of tokens to generate in the completion.<br>The token count of your prompt plus max_tokens cannot exceed the model's context length. Most models have a context length of 2048 tokens (except for the newest models, which support 4096).","生成完成中令牌的最大數量。<br>您的提示令牌數加上 max_tokens 不能超過模型的上下文長度。大多數模型的上下文長度為 2048 個令牌（除了最新模型支援 4096）。"],["Temperature","溫度"],["What sampling temperature to use, between 0 and 2. Higher values like 0.8 will make the output more random, while lower values like 0.2 will make it more focused and deterministic. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or top_p but not both.","使用什麼取樣溫度，介於0到2之間。較高的值如0.8會使輸出更隨機，而較低的值如0.2會使其更專注和確定性。<br>OpenAI通常建議調整此參數或top_p，但不要同時調整兩者。"],["Nucleus sampling (top_p)","核心取樣（top_p）"],["An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both.","溫度取樣的替代方法，稱為核心取樣，模型考慮具有top_p概率質量的標記結果。所以0.1表示只考慮構成前10%概率質量的標記。<br>OpenAI通常建議調整此參數或溫度，但不要同時調整兩者。"],["Frequency Penalty","頻率懲罰"],["Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on their existing frequency in the text so far, decreasing the model's likelihood to repeat the same line verbatim. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details","數值介於-2.0到2.0之間。正值會根據標記在文本中現有的頻率懲罰新標記，減少模型重複相同內容的可能性。<br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details"],["Presence Penalty","存在懲罰"],["Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on whether they appear in the text so far, increasing the model's likelihood to talk about new topics. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details","數值介於-2.0到2.0之間。正值會根據標記是否已在文本中出現來懲罰新標記，增加模型談論新話題的可能性。<br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details"],["Custom Parameter","自定義參數"],["Key","鍵"],["Value","值"],["Type","類型"],["Type of the value.","值的類型。"],["For <b>javascript</b> type, the value will be evaluated as JavaScript code.","對於<b>javascript</b>類型，值將被評估為JavaScript代碼。"],["The scope of the javascript code is <code>window</code>. So you can pretty much grab any value.","JavaScript代碼的作用域是<code>window</code>。因此，您幾乎可以獲取任何值。"],["Example: <code>trans.project.title</code>","示例：<code>trans.project.title</code>"],["Drop parameters that will not be sent to the API.<br />","丟棄不會發送到API的參數。<br />"],["OpenAI API is keep changing, some new models may not support the old parameters and will return HTTP error for unrecognized request parameter.","OpenAI API不斷變化，一些新模型可能不支持舊參數，並會對無法識別的請求參數返回HTTP錯誤。"],["You can drop the parameters that are not supported by the model here.","您可以在這裡丟棄模型不支持的參數。"],["Batch API settings","批次API設置"],["General","一般"],["The OpenAI Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:blue\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.","OpenAI 批次 API 讓您可以非同步翻譯您的專案，成本降低 50%，這意味著您將在<b style=\"color:red\">24 小時內</b>收到翻譯結果，且成本僅為<b style=\"color:blue\">正常價格的一半</b>。這對於不需要即時翻譯結果的大型專案特別有用。"],[" <br />Read more about the Batch API <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch\" external>here</a>.<br />"," <br />了解更多關於批次 API 的資訊，請點擊<a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch\" external>這裡</a>。<br />"],[" <br />Supported services: <b>OpenAI</b> and <b>Gemini</b>"," <br />支援的服務：<b>OpenAI</b> 和 <b>Gemini</b>"],["<h2>More configurations are found in Addon Settings</h2>","<h2>更多配置可在附加元件設定中找到</h2>"],["Open Add-on Settings","開啟附加元件設定"],["Import Configuration from OpenAI Setting","從 OpenAI 設定匯入配置"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["<h2>Don't waste your money on Reasoning Models</h2>","<h2>不要在推理模型上浪費您的金錢</h2>"],["<p>It has been proven by various studies that reasoning models are far worse than the normal models on performing creative writings and translation tasks.</p>","<p>多項研究已證明，推理模型在創意寫作和翻譯任務上的表現遠不如普通模型。</p>"],["<p>You gain nothing but more expensive cost and slower response times when using reasoning models.</p>","<p>使用推理模型只會帶來更高的成本和更慢的回應時間，別無所獲。</p>"],["<h2>If you're using OpenAI</h2>","<h2>如果您正在使用 OpenAI</h2>"],["OpenAI Batch API uses a slightly different model naming convention compared to the standard API. Models in Batch Mode include a -batch suffix. For instance, if you specify <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>, it will automatically be interpreted as <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>.<br />","OpenAI 批次 API 使用的模型命名約定與標準 API 略有不同。批次模式中的模型包含 -batch 後綴。例如，如果您指定 <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>，它將自動被解釋為 <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>。<br />"],["However, at the time this add-on was developed, batch models were not listed under OpenAI’s model usage limits. This means users who have set their Model Usage filter to “Allow” (whitelist) won't be able to access the Batch API.<br />","然而，在開發此附加元件時，批次模型並未列在 OpenAI 的模型使用限制下。這意味著將模型使用篩選器設為「允許」（白名單）的用戶將無法存取批次 API。<br />"],["Click <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\" external>here</a> to change the model's usage limits.","點擊<a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\" external>這裡</a>更改模型的使用限制。"],["Explore more models","探索更多模型"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將演員名稱附加到可翻譯文本"],["Ignore translated rows","忽略已翻譯的行"],["Templates","模板"],["<h2>1. System Message</h2>","<h2>1. 系統訊息</h2>"],["<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>","<p>在這裡，您可以向助手解釋他們的角色是什麼。</p>"],["<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>2. 範例對話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>範例現有對話。您可以撰寫好或壞回應的範例，以幫助翻譯者理解您的目標和對話的上下文。</p>"],["<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>","<h2>3. 您的實際提示</h2>"],["<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>","<p>這是給助理的實際提示。</p>"],["Enable Jailbreak","啟用越獄"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表加入提示中。詞彙表將為每批項目加載，以提高翻譯質量。該功能會嘗試僅加載相關術語，以避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","演員附加資訊欄"],["Enable context","啟用上下文"],["Advanced","進階"],["Custom Parameters","自訂參數"],["You can add custom parameters to the OpenAI Chat API request body. This is useful if you want to add additional parameters that are not available in the form.","您可以向 OpenAI Chat API 請求主體添加自訂參數。這在您想要添加表單中不可用的額外參數時很有用。</p>"],["<h2>Warning</h2>","<h2>警告</h2>"],["<li>Incorrectly setting custom parameters may cause the API request to fail. Make sure you know what you are doing before adding custom parameters. Some services like OpenAI are strict about what parameters you're sending, and they will return HTTP error for unrecognized request parameter.</li>","<li>錯誤設置自訂參數可能導致 API 請求失敗。在添加自訂參數之前，請確保您知道自己在做什麼。某些服務（如 OpenAI）對您發送的參數有嚴格要求，對於無法識別的請求參數，它們將返回 HTTP 錯誤。</li>"],["<li>If the same key is used multiple times, only the last value will be used.</li>","<li>如果同一鍵被多次使用，僅最後一個值會被採用。</li>"],["<li>If the same key in the existing configuration is used, then existing configuration parameter will be overwritten by the custom parameter.</li>","<li>如果使用了現有配置中的相同鍵，則現有配置參數將被自訂參數覆蓋。</li>"],["String","字串"],["Number","數字"],["Boolean","布林值"],["JavaScript","JavaScript"],["Drop Parameters","丟棄參數"],["<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Estimated overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.","<h3>間接成本</h3>\n                        間接成本是您發送給助理的提示訊息成本，不包括實際翻譯文本。成本根據提示訊息中的令牌數量計算。令牌越多，成本越高。<br>\n                        <b>估計間接成本：</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> 令牌 / 請求。"],["Are you sure you want to reset the form?","您確定要重置表單嗎？"],["Translate with Batch API","使用批次API翻譯"],["Are you sure you want to process the batch?\nCost will be incurred for this operation.","您確定要處理批次嗎？\n此操作將產生成本。"],["The batch is successfully created. Do you want to open the batch manager?","批次已成功建立。您要開啟批次管理器嗎？"],["Are you sure you want to import configuration from OpenAI settings? This will overwrite the current configuration.","您確定要從OpenAI設定匯入配置嗎？這將覆蓋當前配置。"],["chatGPT engine is not found","未找到chatGPT引擎"],["Configuration imported successfully.","配置匯入成功。"],["Batch API Queue","批次API佇列"]],"context":[["tid/414/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/424/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/483/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/493/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/531/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/541/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/580/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/590/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/639/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/679/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/689/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/729/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/739/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/782/type/StringLiteral","tid/3377/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/792/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/799/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/838/type/StringLiteral","tid/3408/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/848/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/887/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/897/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/936/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/946/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/985/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/995/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1040/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1050/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1058/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1066/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1079/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1087/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1103/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1111/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1119/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1127/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1135/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1143/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1159/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1167/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1175/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1227/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1237/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1296/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1325/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1351/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1395/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1405/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1444/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1454/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1494/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1504/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1563/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1573/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1632/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1642/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1701/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1711/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1771/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1781/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1857/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1886/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1913/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1940/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1968/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1975/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1982/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1991/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2030/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2044/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2086/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2128/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2161/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2173/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2181/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2205/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2227/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2239/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2272/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2341/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2349/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2357/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2380/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2387/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2391/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2395/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2569/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2769/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2793/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2848/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2881/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2888/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2933/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2940/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3153/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3160/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3314/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3354/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3439/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3463/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3502/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3774/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3807/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3830/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3841/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3848/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3855/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3965/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3975/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3985/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3995/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4051/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4185/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/4435/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4581/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8938/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9430/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9838/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9883/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10067/type/StringLiteral","tid/10130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10328/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"batchAPI.js","dirname":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi","extension":".js","filename":"batchAPI.js","path":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/batchAPI.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Service Name":0,"Service provider for your Batch API.":1,"Your API Key":2,"Please enter your API key for the Batch API service.":3,"Model":4,"The model for your translation.":5,"Source Column":6,"The column of the original texts you want to translate.":7,"Add actor name":8,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":9,"Ignore if already translated":10,"If this option is checked then Translator++ will ignore any row that already has translations on its column.":11,"Filter Tag":12,"If set, only rows with this tag will be translated.":13,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":14,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":15,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":16,"Actor Reference Translation Column":17,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":18,"Actor's Information Column":19,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":20,"Enable Context":21,"Enable context for the translation. The previously translated material above the current batch will be included as a context. <b>You also need to explicitly includes the CONTEXT into the template</b>":22,"Context Character Limit":23,"Character limit for the context.":24,"System Message Template":25,"System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.":26,"You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>":27,"Variables:<br>":28,"<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>":29,"<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>":30,"<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>":31,"<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>":32,"<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>":33,"<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>":34,"<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>":35,"<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>":36,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>":37,"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":38,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":39,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":40,"<li>CONTEXT : Include some previous lines as a context</li>":41,"Body Message Template":42,"Template of the body of your chat.":43,"Sample conversation":44,"User message":45,"Assistant's response":46,"Enable JailBreak":47,"Enable Jailbreak for the translation. This will make the translation more accurate and less biased. Some models may want to relate fictional events to real life events, hence they will try to alter the translation to fit their own narrative. This option will prevent that.":48,"Jailbreak Template":49,"Template of the Jailbreak message.":50,"Maximum Tokens":51,"The maximum number of tokens to generate in the completion.<br>The token count of your prompt plus max_tokens cannot exceed the model's context length. Most models have a context length of 2048 tokens (except for the newest models, which support 4096).":52,"Temperature":53,"What sampling temperature to use, between 0 and 2. Higher values like 0.8 will make the output more random, while lower values like 0.2 will make it more focused and deterministic. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or top_p but not both.":54,"Nucleus sampling (top_p)":55,"An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both.":56,"Frequency Penalty":57,"Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on their existing frequency in the text so far, decreasing the model's likelihood to repeat the same line verbatim. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details":58,"Presence Penalty":59,"Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on whether they appear in the text so far, increasing the model's likelihood to talk about new topics. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details":60,"Custom Parameter":61,"Key":62,"Value":63,"Type":64,"Type of the value.":65,"For <b>javascript</b> type, the value will be evaluated as JavaScript code.":66,"The scope of the javascript code is <code>window</code>. So you can pretty much grab any value.":67,"Example: <code>trans.project.title</code>":68,"Drop parameters that will not be sent to the API.<br />":69,"OpenAI API is keep changing, some new models may not support the old parameters and will return HTTP error for unrecognized request parameter.":70,"You can drop the parameters that are not supported by the model here.":71,"Batch API settings":72,"General":73,"The OpenAI Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:blue\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.":74," <br />Read more about the Batch API <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch\" external>here</a>.<br />":75," <br />Supported services: <b>OpenAI</b> and <b>Gemini</b>":76,"<h2>More configurations are found in Addon Settings</h2>":77,"Open Add-on Settings":78,"Import Configuration from OpenAI Setting":79,"General Settings":80,"<h2>Don't waste your money on Reasoning Models</h2>":81,"<p>It has been proven by various studies that reasoning models are far worse than the normal models on performing creative writings and translation tasks.</p>":82,"<p>You gain nothing but more expensive cost and slower response times when using reasoning models.</p>":83,"<h2>If you're using OpenAI</h2>":84,"OpenAI Batch API uses a slightly different model naming convention compared to the standard API. Models in Batch Mode include a -batch suffix. For instance, if you specify <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>, it will automatically be interpreted as <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>.<br />":85,"However, at the time this add-on was developed, batch models were not listed under OpenAI’s model usage limits. This means users who have set their Model Usage filter to “Allow” (whitelist) won't be able to access the Batch API.<br />":86,"Click <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\" external>here</a> to change the model's usage limits.":87,"Explore more models":88,"Append actor name to the translatable text":89,"Ignore translated rows":90,"Templates":91,"<h2>1. System Message</h2>":92,"<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>":93,"<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>":94,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":95,"<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>":96,"<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>":97,"Enable Jailbreak":98,"Glossary":99,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":100,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":101,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":102,"Enable context":103,"Advanced":104,"Custom Parameters":105,"You can add custom parameters to the OpenAI Chat API request body. This is useful if you want to add additional parameters that are not available in the form.":106,"<h2>Warning</h2>":107,"<li>Incorrectly setting custom parameters may cause the API request to fail. Make sure you know what you are doing before adding custom parameters. Some services like OpenAI are strict about what parameters you're sending, and they will return HTTP error for unrecognized request parameter.</li>":108,"<li>If the same key is used multiple times, only the last value will be used.</li>":109,"<li>If the same key in the existing configuration is used, then existing configuration parameter will be overwritten by the custom parameter.</li>":110,"String":111,"Number":112,"Boolean":113,"JavaScript":114,"Drop Parameters":115,"<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Estimated overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.":116,"Are you sure you want to reset the form?":117,"Translate with Batch API":118,"Are you sure you want to process the batch?\nCost will be incurred for this operation.":119,"The batch is successfully created. Do you want to open the batch manager?":120,"Are you sure you want to import configuration from OpenAI settings? This will overwrite the current configuration.":121,"chatGPT engine is not found":122,"Configuration imported successfully.":123,"Batch API Queue":124},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/batchAPI.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":125,"length":125,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js":{"data":[["Please select the rows to apply the translation","請選擇要套用翻譯的行"],["Target Column","目標欄"],["The column to put the translation result.","放置翻譯結果的欄位。"],["Import translation from ChatGPT Batch","從 ChatGPT 批次匯入翻譯"],["Translation applied to selected rows","翻譯已套用至選取的行"],["Invalid format","格式無效"],["OK","確定"],["Mismatch","不匹配"],["Failed to load batch list with error: \n","載入批次列表失敗，錯誤：\n"],["Download Error File","下載錯誤檔案"],["Batch is not completed yet","批次尚未完成"],["Are you sure you want to cancel this batch?","您確定要取消此批次嗎？"],["Cannot cancel completed batch.","無法取消已完成的批次。"],["Batch cancelled","批次已取消"],["Failed to cancel batch","取消批次失敗"]],"context":[["tid/3027/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3072/type/StringLiteral","tid/12550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3082/type/StringLiteral","tid/12560/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3156/type/StringLiteral","tid/12634/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3496/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3926/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3958/type/StringLiteral","tid/4037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7881/type/StringLiteral","tid/8155/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12498/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/14441/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/14519/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/14577/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/14594/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"chatgpt-batch-manager.js","dirname":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/chatgpt-batch-manager","extension":".js","filename":"chatgpt-batch-manager.js","path":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Please select the rows to apply the translation":0,"Target Column":1,"The column to put the translation result.":2,"Import translation from ChatGPT Batch":3,"Translation applied to selected rows":4,"Invalid format":5,"OK":6,"Mismatch":7,"Failed to load batch list with error: \n":8,"Download Error File":9,"Batch is not completed yet":10,"Are you sure you want to cancel this batch?":11,"Cannot cancel completed batch.":12,"Batch cancelled":13,"Failed to cancel batch":14},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":15,"length":15,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html":{"data":[["Batches","批次"],["Apply translation","套用翻譯"],["Cancel batch","取消批次"],["Status","狀態"],["Batch ID","批次 ID"],["Input File ID","輸入檔案 ID"],["End point","端點"],["Created at","建立於"],["Expires at <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.\"></i>","到期於 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"未及時完成的批次最終會進入過期狀態；該批次中未完成的請求將被取消，而對已完成請求的回應將透過批次的輸出檔案提供。您將被收取已完成請求所消耗的代幣費用。\"></i>"],["Completed at","完成於"],["Errors","錯誤"],["Batch Item Detail of","批次項目詳情"],["ID","ID"],["Completed on","完成於"],["Model","模型"],["Prompt Token","提示代幣"],["Completion Token","完成代幣"],["Total Token","總代幣"],["Status Code","狀態碼"],["error","錯誤"],["Conversation","對話"],["Response Validation","回應驗證"],["Raw Payload","原始負載"],["View raw payload","檢視原始負載"],["Response Preview","回應預覽"],["Apply translations from selected rows","套用所選行的翻譯"],["Here you can edit the translation result individually and send it into Translator++","在此您可以個別編輯翻譯結果並發送至 Translator++"],["Open ChatGPT Settings","開啟 ChatGPT 設定"],["Help","說明"],["File list","檔案清單"],["Collapse / restore left panel","摺疊 / 還原左側面板"],["Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.","未及時完成的批次最終會轉為過期狀態；該批次內未完成的請求將被取消，而對已完成請求的回應可透過批次的輸出檔案取得。您將被收取任何已完成請求所消耗的代幣費用。"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/2/innerText","idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/3/innerText","idx/9/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"]],"basename":"index.html","dirname":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/chatgpt-batch-manager","extension":".html","filename":"index.html","path":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Batches":0,"Apply translation":1,"Cancel batch":2,"Status":3,"Batch ID":4,"Input File ID":5,"End point":6,"Created at":7,"Expires at <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.\"></i>":8,"Completed at":9,"Errors":10,"Batch Item Detail of":11,"ID":12,"Completed on":13,"Model":14,"Prompt Token":15,"Completion Token":16,"Total Token":17,"Status Code":18,"error":19,"Conversation":20,"Response Validation":21,"Raw Payload":22,"View raw payload":23,"Response Preview":24,"Apply translations from selected rows":25,"Here you can edit the translation result individually and send it into Translator++":26,"Open ChatGPT Settings":27,"Help":28,"File list":29,"Collapse / restore left panel":30,"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.":31},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":32,"length":32,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/options.js":{"data":[["Service Name","服務名稱"],["Service provider for your Batch API.","您的批次API服務提供商。"],["API Key","API金鑰"],["Please enter your API key for the Batch API service.","請輸入您的批次API服務的API金鑰。"],["Model","模型"],["The pre-trained model","預訓練模型"],["In ChatGPT, you may need to set the allowed model to be used (https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits).","在ChatGPT中，您可能需要設定允許使用的模型（https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits）。"],["Enable JailBreak","啟用越獄"],["Enable Jailbreak for the translation. This will make the translation more accurate and less biased. Some models may want to relate fictional events to real life events, hence they will try to alter the translation to fit their own narrative. This option will prevent that.","啟用翻譯越獄。這將使翻譯更準確且偏見更少。某些模型可能試圖將虛構事件與現實生活事件關聯，從而嘗試更改翻譯以符合其自身敘述。此選項將防止這種情況。"],["Jailbreak Template","越獄模板"],["Template of the Jailbreak message.","越獄訊息的模板。"],["Maximum Tokens","最大令牌數"],["The maximum number of tokens to generate in the completion.<br>The token count of your prompt plus max_tokens cannot exceed the model's context length. Most models have a context length of 2048 tokens (except for the newest models, which support 4096).","完成中生成的最大令牌數。<br>提示的令牌數加上最大令牌數不能超過模型的上下文長度。大多數模型的上下文長度為2048個令牌（最新的模型除外，支援4096個）。"],["Temperature","溫度"],["What sampling temperature to use, between 0 and 2. Higher values like 0.8 will make the output more random, while lower values like 0.2 will make it more focused and deterministic. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or top_p but not both.","使用的採樣溫度，介於0到2之間。較高的值如0.8會使輸出更隨機，而較低的值如0.2會使其更專注和確定性。<br>OpenAI通常建議調整此參數或top_p，但不要同時調整兩者。"],["Nucleus sampling (top_p)","核心採樣（top_p）"],["An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both.","溫度採樣的替代方法，稱為核心採樣，模型考慮具有top_p概率質量的令牌結果。因此，0.1表示僅考慮構成前10%概率質量的令牌。<br>OpenAI通常建議調整此參數或溫度，但不要同時調整兩者。"],["Frequency Penalty","頻率懲罰"],["Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on their existing frequency in the text so far, decreasing the model's likelihood to repeat the same line verbatim. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details","介於-2.0到2.0之間的數字。正值會根據新令牌在文本中現有的頻率進行懲罰，降低模型重複相同行字面的可能性。<br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details"],["Presence Penalty","存在懲罰"],["Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on whether they appear in the text so far, increasing the model's likelihood to talk about new topics. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details","介於-2.0到2.0之間的數字。正值會根據新令牌是否出現在文本中進行懲罰，增加模型談論新主題的可能性。<br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details"],["Max Characters per Batch","每批次最大字元數"],["Maximum character limit per translation batch.\nThis options will count the original text's character length only, and not the prompt message's character length.","每批次翻譯的最大字元限制。<br>此選項僅計算原始文本的字元長度，不包括提示訊息的長度。"],["Max row per concurrent requests","每個並行請求的最大行數\n設置為<b>0</b>以禁用此功能。"],["How many rows are allowed for each concurrent requests. Set it to <b>0</b> to disable this feature.<br />If this option is disabled then no matter how many <b>Max concurrent requests</b> you set, Translator++ will process the request as a single chunk.<br />","每個並行請求允許的行數。<br>如果禁用此選項，則無論設置多少<b>最大並行請求</b>，Translator++都會將請求作為單個塊處理。<br>"],["The more rows you set, the more translation you can get in a single batch. Hence reduce the overhead cost and increases the chance of the AI returning error results.<br />The lower the number, the less likely the translation will error but will cost you extra for overhead prompts.","設置的行數越多，單一批次中獲得的翻譯越多，從而減少開銷成本，但增加AI返回錯誤結果的機率。<br>數字越低，翻譯出錯的可能性越小，但會因額外提示而增加成本。"],["Code Escaping Algorithm","程式碼轉義算法"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues. You may need to change the <b>System Message Template</b> and <b>Body Message Template</b> according to the escape algorighm of your choice.<br />When you choose <b>JSONCloaking</b>, response_format: { type: 'json_object' } parameter will be sent to ChatGPT automatically. <b>JSONCLoaking</b> is very acurate, but doesn't work with all models, try <b>gpt-3.5-turbo-1106</b>.","對話中內嵌程式碼的轉義算法。您可能需要根據選擇的轉義算法更改<b>系統訊息模板</b>和<b>主體訊息模板</b>。<br>選擇<b>JSONCloaking</b>時，會自動向ChatGPT發送response_format: { type: 'json_object' }參數。<b>JSONCloaking</b>非常準確，但不適用於所有模型，請嘗試<b>gpt-3.5-turbo-1106</b>。"],["The <b>Batch API</b> allows you to submit many requests at once, which are processed asynchronously in the background. You won’t receive results immediately, but the process <b>will be completed within 24 hours</b>—and often much faster. This method <b>costs only half as much as the standard approach</b>.","<b>批次API</b>允許您一次提交多個請求，這些請求在後台異步處理。您不會立即收到結果，但過程<b>將在24小時內完成</b>—通常更快。此方法<b>成本僅為標準方法的一半</b>。"],["Batch API settings","批次API設定"],["General","一般"],["Explore more models","探索更多模型"],["Templates","模板"],["Enable Jailbreak","啟用越獄"],["Advanced","進階"],["Batch Translation Setting","批次翻譯設定"],["Default","預設"],["JavaScript template cloaking","JavaScript模板偽裝"],["None (no escaping)","無（不進行轉義）"]],"context":[["tid/413/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/423/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/479/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/489/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/529/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/539/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/546/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/625/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/635/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/669/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/679/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/716/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/726/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/782/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/792/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/848/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/858/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/914/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/924/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/981/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/991/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1054/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1064/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1122/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1132/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1139/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1217/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1227/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1382/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1406/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1444/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1896/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2069/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2578/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2776/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2786/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"options.js","dirname":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi","extension":".js","filename":"options.js","path":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/options.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Service Name":0,"Service provider for your Batch API.":1,"API Key":2,"Please enter your API key for the Batch API service.":3,"Model":4,"The pre-trained model":5,"In ChatGPT, you may need to set the allowed model to be used (https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits).":6,"Enable JailBreak":7,"Enable Jailbreak for the translation. This will make the translation more accurate and less biased. Some models may want to relate fictional events to real life events, hence they will try to alter the translation to fit their own narrative. This option will prevent that.":8,"Jailbreak Template":9,"Template of the Jailbreak message.":10,"Maximum Tokens":11,"The maximum number of tokens to generate in the completion.<br>The token count of your prompt plus max_tokens cannot exceed the model's context length. Most models have a context length of 2048 tokens (except for the newest models, which support 4096).":12,"Temperature":13,"What sampling temperature to use, between 0 and 2. Higher values like 0.8 will make the output more random, while lower values like 0.2 will make it more focused and deterministic. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or top_p but not both.":14,"Nucleus sampling (top_p)":15,"An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both.":16,"Frequency Penalty":17,"Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on their existing frequency in the text so far, decreasing the model's likelihood to repeat the same line verbatim. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details":18,"Presence Penalty":19,"Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on whether they appear in the text so far, increasing the model's likelihood to talk about new topics. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details":20,"Max Characters per Batch":21,"Maximum character limit per translation batch.\nThis options will count the original text's character length only, and not the prompt message's character length.":22,"Max row per concurrent requests":23,"How many rows are allowed for each concurrent requests. Set it to <b>0</b> to disable this feature.<br />If this option is disabled then no matter how many <b>Max concurrent requests</b> you set, Translator++ will process the request as a single chunk.<br />":24,"The more rows you set, the more translation you can get in a single batch. Hence reduce the overhead cost and increases the chance of the AI returning error results.<br />The lower the number, the less likely the translation will error but will cost you extra for overhead prompts.":25,"Code Escaping Algorithm":26,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues. You may need to change the <b>System Message Template</b> and <b>Body Message Template</b> according to the escape algorighm of your choice.<br />When you choose <b>JSONCloaking</b>, response_format: { type: 'json_object' } parameter will be sent to ChatGPT automatically. <b>JSONCLoaking</b> is very acurate, but doesn't work with all models, try <b>gpt-3.5-turbo-1106</b>.":27,"The <b>Batch API</b> allows you to submit many requests at once, which are processed asynchronously in the background. You won’t receive results immediately, but the process <b>will be completed within 24 hours</b>—and often much faster. This method <b>costs only half as much as the standard approach</b>.":28,"Batch API settings":29,"General":30,"Explore more models":31,"Templates":32,"Enable Jailbreak":33,"Advanced":34,"Batch Translation Setting":35,"Default":36,"JavaScript template cloaking":37,"None (no escaping)":38},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/options.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":39,"length":39,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/transOpenAIAssistant.js":{"data":[["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 角色資訊詞彙表。（僅在批次模式中啟用角色資訊選項時）</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[物件名稱] : 從Translator++物件生成參考。<br />範例：<code>REFERENCE[通用參考]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>","<li>CONTEXT : 先前翻譯的上下文（如果啟用上下文）</li>"],["Sample conversation","範例對話"],["<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>範例對話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>現有對話範例。您可以撰寫良好或不良回應的範例，以幫助翻譯者理解您的目標和對話的上下文。</p>"],["Always separate file","總是分開檔案"],["Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.","總是為每個批次分開檔案。這可以保持每個檔案的上下文不受其他檔案污染。"],["Add actor name","新增角色名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","將角色名稱從行資訊附加到可翻譯文本中。這將幫助譯者追蹤對話和代詞。Translator++ 隨後會從翻譯結果中移除角色名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入角色參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾選，Translator++ 將載入角色參考作為詞彙表。這將幫助譯者理解對話的上下文。角色參考是對話中角色的名稱。這將作為詞彙表載入到譯者中。這會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","只有對話中存在的角色才會為每個批次項目載入為詞彙表。使用模板命令在提示訊息中載入角色參考。"],["<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.","<br />⚠️如果您啟用此選項，還需要在提示模板中包含 <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> 變數以放置角色資訊數據。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色參考翻譯列"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名稱翻譯的列。此列將用作角色參考的翻譯。這將提高對話中角色名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","角色資訊列"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含角色附加資訊的列。您可以放入更多資訊，如性別、年齡等。這將改善對話中代詞的翻譯。"],["Extra Prompt","額外提示"],["Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.","將添加到提示訊息的額外提示。這將在系統訊息之後、實際提示訊息之前添加。"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["Always separate file for each batch","始終為每個批次分開檔案"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將角色名稱附加到可翻譯文本"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表添加到提示中。詞彙表將為每個批次項目載入，以提高翻譯質量。該功能將嘗試僅載入相關術語，以避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","角色附加資訊的列"],["Prompt","提示"]],"context":[["tid/778/type/StringLiteral","tid/4939/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/786/type/StringLiteral","tid/4947/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/794/type/StringLiteral","tid/4955/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/802/type/StringLiteral","tid/4963/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/810/type/StringLiteral","tid/4971/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/879/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2626/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2633/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4657/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4691/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4701/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4738/type/StringLiteral","tid/5148/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4762/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4796/type/StringLiteral","tid/5179/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4806/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4833/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4843/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4873/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4883/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5010/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5036/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5060/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5092/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5118/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5125/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5210/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5241/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"transOpenAIAssistant.js","dirname":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi","extension":".js","filename":"transOpenAIAssistant.js","path":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/transOpenAIAssistant.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":0,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":1,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>":2,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":3,"<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>":4,"Sample conversation":5,"<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>":6,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":7,"Always separate file":8,"Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.":9,"Add actor name":10,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":11,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":12,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":13,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":14,"<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.":15,"Actor Reference Translation Column":16,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":17,"Actor's Information Column":18,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":19,"Extra Prompt":20,"Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.":21,"General Settings":22,"Always separate file for each batch":23,"Append actor name to the translatable text":24,"Glossary":25,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":26,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":27,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":28,"Prompt":29},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/transOpenAIAssistant.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":30,"length":30,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/utility.js":{"data":[["Open Batch Manager","開啟批次管理器"],["This feature is only available if you have a project open.","此功能僅在您開啟專案時可用。"]],"context":[["tid/117/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/156/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"utility.js","dirname":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi","extension":".js","filename":"utility.js","path":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/utility.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Open Batch Manager":0,"This feature is only available if you have a project open.":1},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transLLMBatchApi/utility.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":2,"length":2,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transLitellm/options.js":{"data":[["LiteLLM's proxy url. The url address of your LiteLLM proxy. The default is : <code>http://localhost:8890/chat/completions</code>","LiteLLM 的代理 URL。您的 LiteLLM 代理的網址地址。預設為：<code>http://localhost:8890/chat/completions</code>"],["API's base URL","API 的基礎 URL"],["The base URL of your selected service. Only fill this field if you're using a custom endpoint URL. LiteLLM will automatically detect the base URL based on the given model.<br />The way LiteLLM adds the path to the URL depends on the service. For example, for OpenAI-compatible endpoints, LiteLLM will append <code>/chat/completions</code> to the given URL. So, if your endpoint is <code>https://api.fast-tunnel.one/v1/chat/completions</code>, fill the field with <code>https://api.fast-tunnel.one/v1</code>.","您所選服務的基礎 URL。僅在使用自定義端點 URL 時填寫此欄位。LiteLLM 會根據給定的模型自動偵測基礎 URL。<br />LiteLLM 將路徑添加到 URL 的方式取決於服務。例如，對於 OpenAI 相容端點，LiteLLM 會在給定的 URL 後附加 <code>/chat/completions</code>。因此，如果您的端點是 <code>https://api.fast-tunnel.one/v1/chat/completions</code>，請在此欄位填入 <code>https://api.fast-tunnel.one/v1</code>。"],["API Version","API 版本"],["Optional. The API version parameter needed for some services.","選填。某些服務所需的 API 版本參數。"],["API Key","API 金鑰"],["Optional. The API key used for authenticating your access to the service.","選填。用於驗證您對服務存取權限的 API 金鑰。"],["Model","模型"],["Pre-train the model of your choice. Utilize the LiteLLM model convenience format to specify your preferred model. The format is {service name}/{model}. For example:","預訓練您選擇的模型。使用 LiteLLM 模型便利格式來指定您偏好的模型。格式為 {服務名稱}/{模型}。例如："],["your deployment name","您的部署名稱"],["However, some models have unique names that can be directly identified, like:","然而，某些模型具有可直接識別的獨特名稱，例如："],["Azure AD Token","Azure AD 權杖"],["AWS Access Key ID","AWS 存取金鑰 ID"],["AWS secret access key","AWS 秘密存取金鑰"],["Open router site URL","開啟路由器網站 URL"],["Open router APP name","開啟路由器應用程式名稱"],["Enable Context","啟用上下文"],["Enable context for the translation. The previously translated material above the current batch will be included as a context. <b>You also need to explicitly includes the CONTEXT into the template</b>","為翻譯啟用上下文。當前批次上方先前已翻譯的內容將作為上下文包含在內。<b>您還需要明確將 CONTEXT 包含在模板中</b>"],["Context Character Limit","上下文字元限制"],["Character limit for the context.","上下文的字元限制。"],["System Message Template","系統訊息模板"],["System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.","系統訊息是訊息的標頭，將告知您的 chatGPT 助理的角色。此訊息將作為您發送給 chatGPT 的每個批次的第一條訊息發送。"],["You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>","您可以使用 JavaScript 模板字面值風格包含以下變數 <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>"],["Variables:<br>","變數：<br>"],["<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>","<li>LANG_FROM : 來源語言</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>","<li>LANG_TO : 目標語言</li>"],["<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>","<li>SOURCE_TEXT : 來源文字</li>"],["<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>","<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : 預定義的逃逸演算法訊息。</li>"],["<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>","<li>NEWLINE_STRING : 代表新行的字串（行替代）。</li>"],["<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>","<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : 批次中的訊息數量。</li>"],["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE：遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO：角色資訊詞彙表。（僅在批次模式中啟用角色資訊選項時）</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[物件名稱]：從Translator++物件生成參考。<br />例如：<code>REFERENCE[通用參考]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>","<li>CONTEXT：先前翻譯的上下文（如果啟用上下文）</li>"],["Sample conversation","範例對話"],["User message","使用者訊息"],["Assistant's response","助理的回應"],["Body Message Template","訊息正文範本"],["Template of the body of your message.","訊息正文的範本。"],["Enable JailBreak","啟用越獄"],["Enable Jailbreak for the translation. This will make the translation more accurate and less biased. Some models may want to relate fictional events to real life events, hence they will try to alter the translation to fit their own narrative. This option will prevent that.","為翻譯啟用越獄。這將使翻譯更準確且較少偏見。某些模型可能想將虛構事件與現實生活事件聯繫起來，因此它們會嘗試改變翻譯以符合自己的敘述。此選項將防止這種情況。"],["Jailbreak Template","越獄範本"],["Template of the Jailbreak message.","越獄訊息的範本。"],["Maximum Tokens","最大令牌數"],["The maximum number of tokens to generate in the completion.<br>The token count of your prompt plus max_tokens cannot exceed the model's context length. Most models have a context length of 2048 tokens (except for the newest models, which support 4096).","生成完成中最大令牌數。<br>提示的令牌數加上最大令牌數不能超過模型的上下文長度。大多數模型的上下文長度為2048個令牌（除了最新模型支援4096）。"],["Temperature","溫度"],["What sampling temperature to use, between 0 and 2. Higher values like 0.8 will make the output more random, while lower values like 0.2 will make it more focused and deterministic. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or top_p but not both.","使用的採樣溫度，介於0到2之間。較高的值如0.8將使輸出更隨機，而較低的值如0.2將使其更專注和確定性。<br>OpenAI通常建議調整此值或top_p，但不要同時調整兩者。"],["Nucleus sampling (top_p)","核心採樣（top_p）"],["An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both.","溫度採樣的替代方案，稱為核心採樣，模型考慮具有top_p概率質量的令牌結果。所以0.1表示僅考慮構成前10%概率質量的令牌。<br>OpenAI通常建議調整此值或溫度，但不要同時調整兩者。"],["Frequency Penalty","頻率懲罰"],["Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on their existing frequency in the text so far, decreasing the model's likelihood to repeat the same line verbatim. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details","介於 -2.0 和 2.0 之間的數字。正值會根據新詞在文本中已有的頻率進行懲罰，降低模型重複相同句子的可能性。<br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details"],["Presence Penalty","存在懲罰"],["Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on whether they appear in the text so far, increasing the model's likelihood to talk about new topics. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details","介於 -2.0 和 2.0 之間的數字。正值會根據新詞是否已在文本中出現進行懲罰，增加模型談論新主題的可能性。<br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details"],["Use JSON Schema","使用 JSON 架構"],["Use <code>json_schema</code> for the <code>response_format.type</code> field instead of the old <code>json_object</code>. The <code>json_schema</code> is required by some of the latest models and some servers like <b>LM Studio</b>, but some old models are still using <code>json_object</code>.","使用 <code>json_schema</code> 替代舊的 <code>json_object</code> 作為 <code>response_format.type</code> 欄位。一些最新模型和伺服器（如 <b>LM Studio</b>）要求使用 <code>json_schema</code>，但一些舊模型仍在使用 <code>json_object</code>。"],["Stop","停止"],["Enter a keyword where the API will stop generating further tokens. Separate each entry with a new line.","輸入關鍵字，API 將在此處停止生成更多詞元。每個條目用新行分隔。"],["Additional argument variables","額外參數變數"],["Additional argument variables that would be appended when starting the server.<br />https://docs.litellm.ai/docs/proxy/cli#--drop_params","啟動伺服器時附加的額外參數變數。<br />https://docs.litellm.ai/docs/proxy/cli#--drop_params"],["Batch Timeout","批次超時"],["Timeout for each batch in milisecond","每個批次的超時時間（毫秒）"],["Max Request Length","最大請求長度"],["The maximum length of characters for each translation batch.\nEach translator has a different specs.\nI recommend less than 2000 for WEB front-end translator that uses GET parameter.","每個翻譯批次的最大字元長度。\n每個翻譯器有不同的規格。\n建議使用 GET 參數的 WEB 前端翻譯器設置為少於 2000。"],["Max concurrent requests","最大並行請求數"],["How many concurrent requests are allowed to be connected simultaneously. Set it to <b>0</b> to disable this feature.<br />Combine this option with <b>Max row per concurrent request</b> to boost the translation speed.","允許同時連接的最大並行請求數。設置為 <b>0</b> 以禁用此功能。<br />結合此選項與 <b>每個並行請求的最大行數</b> 以提升翻譯速度。"],["Max row per concurrent requests","每個並行請求的最大行數"],["How many rows are allowed for each concurrent requests. Set it to <b>0</b> to disable this feature.<br />If this option is disabled then no matter how many <b>Max concurrent requests</b> you set, Translator++ will process the request as a single chunk.","每個並行請求允許的最大行數。設置為 <b>0</b> 以禁用此功能。<br />如果禁用此選項，則無論設置多少 <b>最大並行請求數</b>，Translator++ 都會將請求處理為單一區塊。"],["Batch delay","批次延遲"],["Delay between batch (in miliseconds)","批次之間的延遲（毫秒）"],["Code Escaping Algorithm","代碼轉義算法"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues. You may need to change the <b>System Message Template</b> and <b>Body Message Template</b> according to the escape algorighm of your choice.","對話內嵌程式碼的跳脫演算法。您可能需要根據所選的跳脫演算法調整<b>系統訊息模板</b>和<b>主體訊息模板</b>。"],["Number of retry","重試次數"],["How many times the engine should retry when translation output validation fails. If nullish (empty), then no retry.","當翻譯輸出驗證失敗時，引擎應重試的次數。若為空值，則不重試。"],["Retry when the number of translated rows doesn't match original","當翻譯行數與原始行數不符時重試"],["If enabled, the engine will retry when the model returns a different number of translation rows compared to the original payload.","若啟用，當模型返回的翻譯行數與原始載荷不符時，引擎將重試。"],["Retry when the number of lines for each translated row doesn't match original","當每行翻譯的行數與原始行數不符時重試"],["If enabled, the engine will retry when any translated row has different number of lines than its original row.","若啟用，當任何翻譯行的行數與其原始行不同時，引擎將重試。"],["Prompt: Row count mismatch","提示：行數不符"],["Prompt used when retrying due to row/element count mismatch.","因行數/元素數不符而重試時使用的提示。"],["Prompt: Line count mismatch","提示：行數不符（每行）"],["Prompt used when retrying due to per-row line count mismatch.","因每行行數不符而重試時使用的提示。"],["Prompt: Error / Retry instruction","提示：錯誤/重試指示"],["Prompt appended after the mismatch prompt(s) to instruct the model to retry.","在不符提示後附加的提示，指示模型重試。"],["Custom Parameter","自訂參數"],["Key","鍵"],["Value","值"],["Type","類型"],["Type of the value.","值的類型。"],["For <b>javascript</b> type, the value will be evaluated as JavaScript code.","對於<b>javascript</b>類型，值將被評估為JavaScript代碼。"],["The scope of the javascript code is <code>window</code>. So you can pretty much grab any value.","JavaScript代碼的作用域是<code>window</code>。因此，您幾乎可以獲取任何值。"],["<br />Example: <code>trans.project.title</code>","<br />範例：<code>trans.project.title</code>"],["Drop parameters that will not be sent to the API.<br />","丟棄不會發送到API的參數。<br />"],["OpenAI API is keep changing, some new models may not support the old parameters and will return HTTP error for unrecognized request parameter.","OpenAI API持續變更，某些新模型可能不支援舊參數，並會對無法識別的請求參數返回HTTP錯誤。"],["You can drop the parameters that are not supported by the model here.","您可以在這裡丟棄模型不支援的參數。"],["Manage configuration","管理配置"],["Some of the feature of this engine requires ChatGPT add-on to be installed. Please make sure you have installed ChatGPT add-on before using this engine.","此引擎的某些功能需要安裝ChatGPT附加元件。請確保在使用此引擎前已安裝ChatGPT附加元件。"],["Text Completion Setting","文字完成設定"],["General","一般"],["<h2>Don't waste your money on Reasoning Models</h2>","<h2>不要在推理模型上浪費金錢</h2>"],["<p>It has been proven by various studies that reasoning models are far worse than the normal models on performing creative writings and translation tasks.</p>","<p>多項研究已證明，推理模型在執行創意寫作和翻譯任務方面遠不如普通模型。</p>"],["<p>You gain nothing but more expensive cost and slower response times when using reasoning models.</p>","<p>使用推理模型只會帶來更昂貴的成本和更慢的回應時間，毫無益處。</p>"],["Platform specific","平台特定"],["Azure","Azure"],["AWS","AWS"],["Open Router","Open Router"],["Templates","模板"],["Enable context","啟用上下文"],["<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>範例對話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>現有對話範例。您可以撰寫良好或不良回應的樣本，以幫助翻譯者理解您的目標和對話上下文。</p>"],["Retry prompts","重試提示"],["<p>These prompts are appended as extra <b>user</b> messages during retries, right after the previous model output.</p>","<p>這些提示在重試時作為額外的<b>使用者</b>訊息附加，緊接在之前的模型輸出之後。</p>"],["<p>Available variables:</p>","<p>可用變數：</p>"],["Enable Jailbreak","啟用越獄"],["Advanced","進階"],["Custom Parameters","自訂參數"],["You can add custom parameters to the OpenAI Chat API request body. This is useful if you want to add additional parameters that are not available in the form.","您可以向OpenAI Chat API請求主體添加自訂參數。這在您想添加表單中不可用的額外參數時非常有用。"],["<h2>Warning</h2><ul><li>Incorrectly setting custom parameters may cause the API request to fail. Make sure you know what you are doing before adding custom parameters. Some services like OpenAI are strict about what parameters you're sending, and they will return HTTP error for unrecognized request parameter.</li><li>If the same key is used multiple times, only the last value will be used.</li><li>If the same key in the existing configuration is used, then existing configuration parameter will be overwritten by the custom parameter.</li></ul>","<h2>警告</h2><ul><li>錯誤設定自訂參數可能導致API請求失敗。在添加自訂參數前，請確保您知道自己在做什麼。某些服務如OpenAI對您發送的參數有嚴格要求，對於無法識別的請求參數，它們會返回HTTP錯誤。</li><li>如果同一鍵被多次使用，僅最後一個值會被採用。</li><li>如果使用了現有配置中的相同鍵，則現有配置參數將被自訂參數覆蓋。</li></ul>"],["Drop Parameters","刪除參數"],["LiteLLM Proxy Configuration","LiteLLM代理配置"],["Start LiteLLM server","啟動LiteLLM伺服器"],["Processing...","處理中..."],["Server started on port ","伺服器已啟動於端口 "],["Check LiteLLM Status","檢查LiteLLM狀態"],["Change LiteLLM Version","變更LiteLLM版本"],["Enter the new version of LiteLLM you wish to install.\nKnown working version: 1.38.0, 1.49.4 \nThe suggested version is: ","輸入您希望安裝的LiteLLM新版本。\n已知可運行的版本：1.38.0、1.49.4 \n建議版本為："],["Are you sure you want to install LiteLLM version ","您確定要安裝LiteLLM版本 "],["Failed to install LiteLLM. Please check the console for more details.","安裝LiteLLM失敗。請檢查控制台以獲取更多詳情。"],["LiteLLM has been successfully updated to version ","LiteLLM已成功更新至版本 "],["Batch Translation Setting","批次翻譯設定"],["Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.","抱歉，此附加元件僅供活躍贊助者使用。\n您可以通過成為$1贊助者來解鎖此功能。"],["Retries and Refinement","重試與精煉"],["<h2>Retries and Refinement</h2>","<h2>重試與精煉</h2>"],["<p>When the translation output fails the validation, Translator++ can ask the model to retry the translation. You can set how many times the model should retry and also set the condition for the retry.</p>","<p>當翻譯輸出未通過驗證時，Translator++ 可以要求模型重試翻譯。您可以設定模型應重試的次數，以及重試的條件。</p>"],["<p>Setting a reasonable number of retries with proper retry conditions can significantly improve the translation quality while keeping the cost and time in check.</p>","<p>設定合理的重試次數與適當的重試條件，可以在控制成本與時間的同時，顯著提升翻譯品質。</p>"],["<p><b>Each retry costs you additional time and money</b>. If your batch ends up retrying frequently, you may want to adjust your prompt to make the instructions clearer for the model.</p>","<p><b>每次重試都會增加額外的時間與金錢成本</b>。如果您的批次翻譯頻繁重試，建議調整提示詞，使指令對模型更清晰。</p>"],["<p>Use developer tool or Batch Manager to debug your batch translation.</p>","<p>使用開發者工具或批次管理器來除錯您的批次翻譯。</p>"],["<h2>Code Escaping Algorithm</h2>","<h2>程式碼跳脫演算法</h2>"],["<p>Code escaping is a technique to prevent the MTL from altering the code snippets inside the dialogues. This is useful when your dialogues contains code snippets such as HTML tags, XML tags, JSON objects, or JavaScript templates.</p>","<p>程式碼跳脫是一種技術，用於防止 MTL 修改對話中的程式碼片段。這在對話包含 HTML 標籤、XML 標籤、JSON 物件或 JavaScript 模板等程式碼片段時非常有用。</p>"],["<p>Choose the escaping algorithm that matches the code snippets inside your dialogues. You may need to adjust the <b>system message</b>, <b>Sample prompt</b> and <b>body message</b> templates accordingly.</p>","<p>選擇與對話中程式碼片段匹配的跳脫演算法。您可能需要相應調整 <b>系統訊息</b>、<b>範例提示</b> 和 <b>主體訊息</b> 模板。</p>"],["<p>Click <a href='https://dreamsavior.net/docs/translator/code-escaping-algorithm/' external>here</a> to read more about code escaping algorithms and how to use them effectively.</p>","<p>點擊 <a href='https://dreamsavior.net/docs/translator/code-escaping-algorithm/' external>此處</a> 閱讀更多關於程式碼跳脫演算法及其有效使用的資訊。</p>"],["JavaScript template cloaking","JavaScript 模板偽裝"],["None (no escaping)","無（不跳脫）"],["Do you want to load the sample dialogue preset for the selected escape algorithm? This will overwrite your existing sample dialogue.","是否要載入所選跳脫演算法的範例對話預設？這將覆蓋您現有的範例對話。"],["Always separate file","始終分開檔案"],["Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.","始終為每個批次分開檔案。這可以保持每個檔案的上下文不受其他檔案污染。"],["Add actor name","添加角色名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","將行資訊中的角色名稱附加到可翻譯文本中。這有助於翻譯者追蹤對話和代詞。Translator++ 隨後會從翻譯結果中移除角色名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入角色參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾選，Translator++ 將載入角色參考作為詞彙表。這有助於翻譯者理解對話的上下文。角色參考是對話中角色的名稱。這將作為詞彙表載入給翻譯者。這會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","僅載入對話中存在的角色作為每個批次項目的詞彙表。使用模板指令在提示訊息中載入角色參考。"],["<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.","<br />⚠️如果啟用此選項，您還需要在提示模板中包含 <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> 變數以放置角色資訊資料。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色參考翻譯欄位"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名稱翻譯的欄位。此欄位將用作角色參考的翻譯，以提高對話中角色名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","角色資訊欄位"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含角色額外資訊的欄位。您可以放入更多資訊，例如性別、年齡等，這將改善對話中代名詞的翻譯。"],["Extra Prompt","額外提示"],["Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.","將添加到提示訊息中的額外提示。這將在系統訊息之後、實際提示訊息之前添加。"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["Always separate file for each batch","始終為每個批次使用單獨的檔案"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將角色名稱附加到可翻譯文字"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表添加到提示中。詞彙表將為每個批次項目加載，以提高翻譯質量。該功能將嘗試僅加載相關術語，以避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","角色額外資訊的欄位"],["Prompt","提示"]],"context":[["tid/576/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/618/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/628/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/680/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/722/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/768/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/782/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/790/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/798/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/880/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/923/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/966/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1009/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1052/type/StringLiteral","tid/1062/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1103/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1113/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1146/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1156/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1190/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1200/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1216/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1229/type/StringLiteral","tid/1492/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1237/type/StringLiteral","tid/1500/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1245/type/StringLiteral","tid/1508/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1253/type/StringLiteral","tid/1516/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1261/type/StringLiteral","tid/1524/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1269/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1277/type/StringLiteral","tid/8920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1285/type/StringLiteral","tid/8928/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1293/type/StringLiteral","tid/8936/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1301/type/StringLiteral","tid/8944/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1309/type/StringLiteral","tid/8952/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1378/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1407/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1433/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1479/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1571/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1581/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1615/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1625/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1662/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1672/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1728/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1738/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1794/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1870/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1927/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1937/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1994/type/StringLiteral","tid/5919/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2004/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2044/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2054/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2091/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2101/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2138/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2148/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2181/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2191/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2247/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2257/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2315/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2325/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2393/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2433/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2443/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2524/type/StringLiteral","tid/7772/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral","tid/7782/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2583/type/StringLiteral","tid/7947/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2593/type/StringLiteral","tid/7957/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2635/type/StringLiteral","tid/8028/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2645/type/StringLiteral","tid/8038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2687/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2697/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2739/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2749/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2791/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2801/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2861/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2890/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2917/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2944/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2972/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2979/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2986/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2993/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3032/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3039/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3046/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3093/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3332/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3355/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3401/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3780/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3788/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3796/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3886/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3919/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4013/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4316/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4349/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4583/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4590/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4898/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4924/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4931/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5296/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5990/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6023/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6046/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6292/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6465/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6573/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6669/type/StringLiteral","tid/6858/type/StringLiteral","tid/7000/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6710/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6762/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6921/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7089/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7207/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7226/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7281/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7402/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7694/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7720/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7727/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7734/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7741/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8117/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8124/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8138/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8168/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8178/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8425/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8628/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8638/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8672/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8682/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8719/type/StringLiteral","tid/9129/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8729/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8736/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8777/type/StringLiteral","tid/9160/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8787/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8814/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8824/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8864/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8991/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9017/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9041/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9073/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9099/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9106/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9191/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9222/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"options.js","dirname":"/addons/transLitellm","extension":".js","filename":"options.js","path":"/addons/transLitellm/options.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"LiteLLM's proxy url. The url address of your LiteLLM proxy. The default is : <code>http://localhost:8890/chat/completions</code>":0,"API's base URL":1,"The base URL of your selected service. Only fill this field if you're using a custom endpoint URL. LiteLLM will automatically detect the base URL based on the given model.<br />The way LiteLLM adds the path to the URL depends on the service. For example, for OpenAI-compatible endpoints, LiteLLM will append <code>/chat/completions</code> to the given URL. So, if your endpoint is <code>https://api.fast-tunnel.one/v1/chat/completions</code>, fill the field with <code>https://api.fast-tunnel.one/v1</code>.":2,"API Version":3,"Optional. The API version parameter needed for some services.":4,"API Key":5,"Optional. The API key used for authenticating your access to the service.":6,"Model":7,"Pre-train the model of your choice. Utilize the LiteLLM model convenience format to specify your preferred model. The format is {service name}/{model}. For example:":8,"your deployment name":9,"However, some models have unique names that can be directly identified, like:":10,"Azure AD Token":11,"AWS Access Key ID":12,"AWS secret access key":13,"Open router site URL":14,"Open router APP name":15,"Enable Context":16,"Enable context for the translation. The previously translated material above the current batch will be included as a context. <b>You also need to explicitly includes the CONTEXT into the template</b>":17,"Context Character Limit":18,"Character limit for the context.":19,"System Message Template":20,"System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.":21,"You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>":22,"Variables:<br>":23,"<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>":24,"<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>":25,"<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>":26,"<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>":27,"<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>":28,"<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>":29,"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":30,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":31,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>":32,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":33,"<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>":34,"Sample conversation":35,"User message":36,"Assistant's response":37,"Body Message Template":38,"Template of the body of your message.":39,"Enable JailBreak":40,"Enable Jailbreak for the translation. This will make the translation more accurate and less biased. Some models may want to relate fictional events to real life events, hence they will try to alter the translation to fit their own narrative. This option will prevent that.":41,"Jailbreak Template":42,"Template of the Jailbreak message.":43,"Maximum Tokens":44,"The maximum number of tokens to generate in the completion.<br>The token count of your prompt plus max_tokens cannot exceed the model's context length. Most models have a context length of 2048 tokens (except for the newest models, which support 4096).":45,"Temperature":46,"What sampling temperature to use, between 0 and 2. Higher values like 0.8 will make the output more random, while lower values like 0.2 will make it more focused and deterministic. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or top_p but not both.":47,"Nucleus sampling (top_p)":48,"An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered. <br>OpenAI generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both.":49,"Frequency Penalty":50,"Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on their existing frequency in the text so far, decreasing the model's likelihood to repeat the same line verbatim. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details":51,"Presence Penalty":52,"Number between -2.0 and 2.0. Positive values penalize new tokens based on whether they appear in the text so far, increasing the model's likelihood to talk about new topics. <br>https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/parameter-details":53,"Use JSON Schema":54,"Use <code>json_schema</code> for the <code>response_format.type</code> field instead of the old <code>json_object</code>. The <code>json_schema</code> is required by some of the latest models and some servers like <b>LM Studio</b>, but some old models are still using <code>json_object</code>.":55,"Stop":56,"Enter a keyword where the API will stop generating further tokens. Separate each entry with a new line.":57,"Additional argument variables":58,"Additional argument variables that would be appended when starting the server.<br />https://docs.litellm.ai/docs/proxy/cli#--drop_params":59,"Batch Timeout":60,"Timeout for each batch in milisecond":61,"Max Request Length":62,"The maximum length of characters for each translation batch.\nEach translator has a different specs.\nI recommend less than 2000 for WEB front-end translator that uses GET parameter.":63,"Max concurrent requests":64,"How many concurrent requests are allowed to be connected simultaneously. Set it to <b>0</b> to disable this feature.<br />Combine this option with <b>Max row per concurrent request</b> to boost the translation speed.":65,"Max row per concurrent requests":66,"How many rows are allowed for each concurrent requests. Set it to <b>0</b> to disable this feature.<br />If this option is disabled then no matter how many <b>Max concurrent requests</b> you set, Translator++ will process the request as a single chunk.":67,"Batch delay":68,"Delay between batch (in miliseconds)":69,"Code Escaping Algorithm":70,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues. You may need to change the <b>System Message Template</b> and <b>Body Message Template</b> according to the escape algorighm of your choice.":71,"Number of retry":72,"How many times the engine should retry when translation output validation fails. If nullish (empty), then no retry.":73,"Retry when the number of translated rows doesn't match original":74,"If enabled, the engine will retry when the model returns a different number of translation rows compared to the original payload.":75,"Retry when the number of lines for each translated row doesn't match original":76,"If enabled, the engine will retry when any translated row has different number of lines than its original row.":77,"Prompt: Row count mismatch":78,"Prompt used when retrying due to row/element count mismatch.":79,"Prompt: Line count mismatch":80,"Prompt used when retrying due to per-row line count mismatch.":81,"Prompt: Error / Retry instruction":82,"Prompt appended after the mismatch prompt(s) to instruct the model to retry.":83,"Custom Parameter":84,"Key":85,"Value":86,"Type":87,"Type of the value.":88,"For <b>javascript</b> type, the value will be evaluated as JavaScript code.":89,"The scope of the javascript code is <code>window</code>. So you can pretty much grab any value.":90,"<br />Example: <code>trans.project.title</code>":91,"Drop parameters that will not be sent to the API.<br />":92,"OpenAI API is keep changing, some new models may not support the old parameters and will return HTTP error for unrecognized request parameter.":93,"You can drop the parameters that are not supported by the model here.":94,"Manage configuration":95,"Some of the feature of this engine requires ChatGPT add-on to be installed. Please make sure you have installed ChatGPT add-on before using this engine.":96,"Text Completion Setting":97,"General":98,"<h2>Don't waste your money on Reasoning Models</h2>":99,"<p>It has been proven by various studies that reasoning models are far worse than the normal models on performing creative writings and translation tasks.</p>":100,"<p>You gain nothing but more expensive cost and slower response times when using reasoning models.</p>":101,"Platform specific":102,"Azure":103,"AWS":104,"Open Router":105,"Templates":106,"Enable context":107,"<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>":108,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":109,"Retry prompts":110,"<p>These prompts are appended as extra <b>user</b> messages during retries, right after the previous model output.</p>":111,"<p>Available variables:</p>":112,"Enable Jailbreak":113,"Advanced":114,"Custom Parameters":115,"You can add custom parameters to the OpenAI Chat API request body. This is useful if you want to add additional parameters that are not available in the form.":116,"<h2>Warning</h2><ul><li>Incorrectly setting custom parameters may cause the API request to fail. Make sure you know what you are doing before adding custom parameters. Some services like OpenAI are strict about what parameters you're sending, and they will return HTTP error for unrecognized request parameter.</li><li>If the same key is used multiple times, only the last value will be used.</li><li>If the same key in the existing configuration is used, then existing configuration parameter will be overwritten by the custom parameter.</li></ul>":117,"Drop Parameters":118,"LiteLLM Proxy Configuration":119,"Start LiteLLM server":120,"Processing...":121,"Server started on port ":122,"Check LiteLLM Status":123,"Change LiteLLM Version":124,"Enter the new version of LiteLLM you wish to install.\nKnown working version: 1.38.0, 1.49.4 \nThe suggested version is: ":125,"Are you sure you want to install LiteLLM version ":126,"Failed to install LiteLLM. Please check the console for more details.":127,"LiteLLM has been successfully updated to version ":128,"Batch Translation Setting":129,"Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.":130,"Retries and Refinement":131,"<h2>Retries and Refinement</h2>":132,"<p>When the translation output fails the validation, Translator++ can ask the model to retry the translation. You can set how many times the model should retry and also set the condition for the retry.</p>":133,"<p>Setting a reasonable number of retries with proper retry conditions can significantly improve the translation quality while keeping the cost and time in check.</p>":134,"<p><b>Each retry costs you additional time and money</b>. If your batch ends up retrying frequently, you may want to adjust your prompt to make the instructions clearer for the model.</p>":135,"<p>Use developer tool or Batch Manager to debug your batch translation.</p>":136,"<h2>Code Escaping Algorithm</h2>":137,"<p>Code escaping is a technique to prevent the MTL from altering the code snippets inside the dialogues. This is useful when your dialogues contains code snippets such as HTML tags, XML tags, JSON objects, or JavaScript templates.</p>":138,"<p>Choose the escaping algorithm that matches the code snippets inside your dialogues. You may need to adjust the <b>system message</b>, <b>Sample prompt</b> and <b>body message</b> templates accordingly.</p>":139,"<p>Click <a href='https://dreamsavior.net/docs/translator/code-escaping-algorithm/' external>here</a> to read more about code escaping algorithms and how to use them effectively.</p>":140,"JavaScript template cloaking":141,"None (no escaping)":142,"Do you want to load the sample dialogue preset for the selected escape algorithm? This will overwrite your existing sample dialogue.":143,"Always separate file":144,"Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.":145,"Add actor name":146,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":147,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":148,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":149,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":150,"<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.":151,"Actor Reference Translation Column":152,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":153,"Actor's Information Column":154,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":155,"Extra Prompt":156,"Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.":157,"General Settings":158,"Always separate file for each batch":159,"Append actor name to the translatable text":160,"Glossary":161,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":162,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":163,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":164,"Prompt":165},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transLitellm/options.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":166,"length":166,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/batchAPI.js":{"data":[["Translate with OpenAI Batch API","使用 OpenAI 批次 API 翻譯"],["Model","模型"],["The pre-trained model.","預訓練模型。"],["It seems that the OpenAI Batch API uses a slightly different model naming convention than the generally used API. Models used in the Batch API have a “-batch” prefix. For example, if you use <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>, the model automatically becomes <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>.<br />\nHowever, as of the time this add-on was created, batch models are not listed in OpenAI's model usage limits, which makes it impossible for users to use the Batch API if they've set the Model Usage filter to “Allow” (whitelist).<br />\nThis is likely a bug in the OpenAI UI that may be fixed in the future.<br />\nSo, make sure to set the usage limits in OpenAI to “Block” (blacklist) mode in order to use the Batch API.<br />\nClick here to change the model's usage limits: https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\n","OpenAI 批次 API 使用的模型命名約定似乎與一般使用的 API 略有不同。批次 API 中使用的模型帶有“-batch”前綴。例如，如果您使用 <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>，模型會自動變為 <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>。<br />\n然而，截至本附加元件創建時，批次模型未列在 OpenAI 的模型使用限制中，這使得用戶如果將模型使用過濾器設置為“允許”（白名單），則無法使用批次 API。<br />\n這可能是 OpenAI UI 中的一個錯誤，未來可能會修復。<br />\n因此，請確保將 OpenAI 中的使用限制設置為“阻止”（黑名單）模式，以便使用批次 API。<br />\n點擊此處更改模型的使用限制：https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\n"],["Source Column","來源欄位"],["The column of the original texts you want to translate.","您想要翻譯的原始文本列。"],["Add actor name","添加角色名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","將角色名稱從行資訊附加到可翻譯文本中。這將幫助譯者追蹤對話和人稱代詞。Translator++ 隨後會從翻譯結果中移除角色名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Ignore if already translated","忽略已翻譯的內容"],["If this option is checked then Translator++ will ignore any row that already has translations on its column.","如果勾選此選項，Translator++ 將忽略任何其列中已有翻譯的行。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入角色參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾選，Translator++ 將載入角色參考作為詞彙表。這將幫助譯者理解對話的上下文。角色參考是對話中角色的名稱。這將作為詞彙表載入到譯者中。這會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","只有對話中存在的角色才會被載入為每個批次項目的詞彙表。使用模板命令在提示訊息中載入角色參考。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色參考翻譯列"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名稱翻譯的列。此列將用作角色參考的翻譯。這將提高對話中角色名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","角色資訊列"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含角色附加資訊的列。您可以放入更多資訊，如性別、年齡等。這將改善對話中人稱代詞的翻譯。"],["System Message Template","系統訊息模板"],["System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.","系統訊息是訊息的標頭，將告知您的 chatGPT 助手的角色。此訊息將作為您發送給 chatGPT 的每個批次的第一條訊息發送。"],["You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>","您可以使用 JavaScript 的模板字面值風格包含以下變數 <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>"],["Variables:<br>","變數：<br>"],["<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>","<li>LANG_FROM : 來源語言</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>","<li>LANG_TO : 目標語言</li>"],["<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>","<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : 完整來源語言名稱</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>","<li>LANG_TO_FULL : 完整目標語言名稱</li>"],["<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>","<li>SOURCE_TEXT : 原始文本</li>"],["<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>","<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : 預定義的轉義演算法訊息。</li>"],["<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>","<li>NEWLINE_STRING : 代表換行的字串（行替代）。</li>"],["<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>","<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : 批次中的訊息數量。</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 新增角色的資訊。</li>"],["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 遊戲標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 遊戲引擎</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[object name] : 從 Translator++ 物件生成參考。<br />範例：<code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Include some previous lines as a context</li>","<li>CONTEXT : 包含一些前幾行作為上下文</li>"],["Body Message Template","主體訊息範本"],["Template of the body of your chat.","您的聊天主體範本。"],["Sample conversation","範例對話"],["The OpenAI Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:blue\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.","OpenAI 批次 API 允許您以 50% 更低的成本非同步翻譯您的專案，這意味著您將在 <b style=\"color:red\">24 小時內</b>收到翻譯結果，且成本為 <b style=\"color:blue\">正常價格的一半</b>。這對於不需要立即翻譯結果的大型專案特別有用。"],[" <br />Read more about the OpenAI Batch API <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch\" external>here</a>."," <br />閱讀更多關於 OpenAI 批次 API 的資訊 <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch\" external>此處</a>。"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["This form is using your OpenAI Batch API configuration.<br>","此表單使用您的 OpenAI 批次 API 配置。<br>"],["You can change the configuration by going to the <b>OpenAI Batch API</b> add-on's settings in the options window.<br>","您可以透過前往選項視窗中的 <b>OpenAI 批次 API</b> 附加元件設定來更改配置。<br>"],["There you can set the API key, model, and other settings.<br />","在那裡，您可以設定 API 金鑰、模型和其他設定。<br />"],["<input type=\"button\" href=\"#\" onclick='ui.openOptionsWindow({focus: {menu: \"transOpenAIBatch\",find: \"Your OpenAI API Key\"}});' value=\"Open ChatGPT settings\" />","<input type=\"button\" href=\"#\" onclick='ui.openOptionsWindow({focus: {menu: \"transOpenAIBatch\",find: \"Your OpenAI API Key\"}});' value=\"開啟 ChatGPT 設定\" />"],["<h2>Don't waste your money on Reasoning Models</h2>","<h2>不要在推理模型上浪費您的金錢</h2>"],["<p>It has been proven by various studies that reasoning models are far worse than the normal models on performing creative writings and translation tasks.</p>","<p>多項研究已證明，推理模型在執行創意寫作和翻譯任務上，遠比普通模型差。</p>"],["<p>You gain nothing but more expensive cost and slower response times when using reasoning models.</p>","<p>使用推理模型只會帶來更高的成本和更慢的回應時間。</p>"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將演員名稱附加到可翻譯文本"],["Ignore translated rows","忽略已翻譯行"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表加入提示中。詞彙表將為每批項目加載，以提高翻譯質量。該功能會嘗試僅加載相關術語，以避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","演員附加資訊欄位"],["Prompt Template","提示模板"],["<h2>1. System Message</h2>","<h2>1. 系統訊息</h2>"],["<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>","<p>這裡您可以向助手解釋他們的角色是什麼。</p>"],["<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>2. 示例對話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>現有對話示例。您可以撰寫良好或不良回應的示例，以幫助翻譯者理解您的目標和對話上下文。</p>"],["<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>","<h2>3. 您的實際提示</h2>"],["<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>","<p>這是發送給助手的實際提示。</p>"],["<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Estimated overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.","<h3>額外成本</h3>\n                        額外成本是指您在發送給助手的提示訊息中，不包含實際翻譯文本的部分所產生的成本。成本根據提示訊息中的令牌數量計算。令牌越多，成本越高。<br>\n                        <b>估計額外成本：</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> 令牌 / 請求。"],["Are you sure you want to reset the form?","您確定要重置表單嗎？"],["Are you sure you want to process the batch?\nCost will be incurred for this operation.","您確定要處理批次嗎？\n此操作將產生成本。"],["The batch is successfully created. Do you want to open the batch manager?","批次已成功創建。您要開啟批次管理器嗎？"],["OpenAI Batch API Queue","OpenAI 批次 API 隊列"]],"context":[["tid/319/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/418/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/428/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/437/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/474/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/511/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/521/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/556/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/566/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629/type/StringLiteral","tid/1634/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/639/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/646/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/680/type/StringLiteral","tid/1665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/690/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/717/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/727/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/833/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/843/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/851/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/859/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/872/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/880/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/888/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/896/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/904/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/912/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/928/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/936/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/944/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/952/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/960/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/968/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1007/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1017/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1063/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1158/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1170/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1194/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1220/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1228/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1235/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1242/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1287/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1295/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1303/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1502/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1526/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1578/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1604/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1611/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1696/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1790/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1797/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1842/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1849/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1975/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1982/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2036/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2253/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6512/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6990/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7239/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"batchAPI.js","dirname":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch","extension":".js","filename":"batchAPI.js","path":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/batchAPI.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Translate with OpenAI Batch API":0,"Model":1,"The pre-trained model.":2,"It seems that the OpenAI Batch API uses a slightly different model naming convention than the generally used API. Models used in the Batch API have a “-batch” prefix. For example, if you use <code>gpt-4.1-mini</code>, the model automatically becomes <code>gpt-4.1-mini-batch</code>.<br />\nHowever, as of the time this add-on was created, batch models are not listed in OpenAI's model usage limits, which makes it impossible for users to use the Batch API if they've set the Model Usage filter to “Allow” (whitelist).<br />\nThis is likely a bug in the OpenAI UI that may be fixed in the future.<br />\nSo, make sure to set the usage limits in OpenAI to “Block” (blacklist) mode in order to use the Batch API.<br />\nClick here to change the model's usage limits: https://platform.openai.com/settings/proj_xxx/limits\n":3,"Source Column":4,"The column of the original texts you want to translate.":5,"Add actor name":6,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":7,"Ignore if already translated":8,"If this option is checked then Translator++ will ignore any row that already has translations on its column.":9,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":10,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":11,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":12,"Actor Reference Translation Column":13,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":14,"Actor's Information Column":15,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":16,"System Message Template":17,"System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.":18,"You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>":19,"Variables:<br>":20,"<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>":21,"<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>":22,"<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>":23,"<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>":24,"<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>":25,"<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>":26,"<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>":27,"<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>":28,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>":29,"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":30,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":31,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":32,"<li>CONTEXT : Include some previous lines as a context</li>":33,"Body Message Template":34,"Template of the body of your chat.":35,"Sample conversation":36,"The OpenAI Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:blue\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.":37," <br />Read more about the OpenAI Batch API <a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch\" external>here</a>.":38,"General Settings":39,"This form is using your OpenAI Batch API configuration.<br>":40,"You can change the configuration by going to the <b>OpenAI Batch API</b> add-on's settings in the options window.<br>":41,"There you can set the API key, model, and other settings.<br />":42,"<input type=\"button\" href=\"#\" onclick='ui.openOptionsWindow({focus: {menu: \"transOpenAIBatch\",find: \"Your OpenAI API Key\"}});' value=\"Open ChatGPT settings\" />":43,"<h2>Don't waste your money on Reasoning Models</h2>":44,"<p>It has been proven by various studies that reasoning models are far worse than the normal models on performing creative writings and translation tasks.</p>":45,"<p>You gain nothing but more expensive cost and slower response times when using reasoning models.</p>":46,"Append actor name to the translatable text":47,"Ignore translated rows":48,"Glossary":49,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":50,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":51,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":52,"Prompt Template":53,"<h2>1. System Message</h2>":54,"<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>":55,"<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>":56,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":57,"<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>":58,"<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>":59,"<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Estimated overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.":60,"Are you sure you want to reset the form?":61,"Are you sure you want to process the batch?\nCost will be incurred for this operation.":62,"The batch is successfully created. Do you want to open the batch manager?":63,"OpenAI Batch API Queue":64},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/batchAPI.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":65,"length":65,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js":{"data":[["Please select the rows to apply the translation","請選擇要應用翻譯的行"],["Target Column","目標欄位"],["The column to put the translation result.","放置翻譯結果的欄位。"],["Import translation from ChatGPT Batch","從 ChatGPT 批次導入翻譯"],["Translation applied to selected rows","翻譯已應用於選定的行"],["Invalid format","格式無效"],["OK","確定"],["Mismatch","不匹配"],["Failed to load batch list with error: \n","載入批次清單失敗，錯誤：\n"],["Download Error File","下載錯誤檔案"],["Batch is not completed yet","批次尚未完成"],["Are you sure you want to cancel this batch?","您確定要取消此批次嗎？"],["Cannot cancel completed batch.","無法取消已完成的批次。"],["Batch cancelled","批次已取消"],["Failed to cancel batch","取消批次失敗"]],"context":[["tid/1733/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1778/type/StringLiteral","tid/11153/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1788/type/StringLiteral","tid/11163/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1862/type/StringLiteral","tid/11237/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2202/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2632/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2664/type/StringLiteral","tid/2743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2711/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6535/type/StringLiteral","tid/6796/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8758/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11101/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12975/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/13053/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/13111/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/13128/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"chatgpt-batch-manager.js","dirname":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/chatgpt-batch-manager","extension":".js","filename":"chatgpt-batch-manager.js","path":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Please select the rows to apply the translation":0,"Target Column":1,"The column to put the translation result.":2,"Import translation from ChatGPT Batch":3,"Translation applied to selected rows":4,"Invalid format":5,"OK":6,"Mismatch":7,"Failed to load batch list with error: \n":8,"Download Error File":9,"Batch is not completed yet":10,"Are you sure you want to cancel this batch?":11,"Cannot cancel completed batch.":12,"Batch cancelled":13,"Failed to cancel batch":14},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/chatgpt-batch-manager/chatgpt-batch-manager.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":15,"length":15,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html":{"data":[["Batches","批次"],["Apply translation","應用翻譯"],["Cancel batch","取消批次"],["Status","狀態"],["Batch ID","批次 ID"],["Input File ID","輸入檔案 ID"],["End point","端點"],["Created at","建立於"],["Expires at <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.\"></i>","到期於 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"未及時完成的批次最終會進入過期狀態；該批次中未完成的請求將被取消，而對已完成請求的任何回應將透過批次的輸出檔案提供。您將被收取已完成請求所消耗的代幣費用。\"></i>"],["Completed at","完成於"],["Errors","錯誤"],["Batch Item Detail of","批次項目詳細資訊："],["ID","ID"],["Completed on","完成於"],["Model","模型"],["Prompt Token","提示令牌"],["Completion Token","完成令牌"],["Total Token","總令牌數"],["Status Code","狀態碼"],["error","錯誤"],["Conversation","對話"],["Response Validation","回應驗證"],["Raw Payload","原始負載"],["View raw payload","檢視原始負載"],["Response Preview","回應預覽"],["Apply translations from selected rows","套用選取列的翻譯"],["Here you can edit the translation result individually and send it into Translator++","在此您可以個別編輯翻譯結果並將其發送至 Translator++"],["Open ChatGPT Settings","開啟 ChatGPT 設定"],["Help","幫助"],["File list","檔案列表"],["Collapse / restore left panel","收合 / 還原左側面板"],["Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.","未及時完成的批次最終會進入過期狀態；該批次中未完成的請求將被取消，而對已完成請求的任何回應可透過該批次的輸出檔案取得。您將被收取已完成請求所消耗的令牌費用。"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/2/innerText","idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/3/innerText","idx/9/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"]],"basename":"index.html","dirname":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/chatgpt-batch-manager","extension":".html","filename":"index.html","path":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Batches":0,"Apply translation":1,"Cancel batch":2,"Status":3,"Batch ID":4,"Input File ID":5,"End point":6,"Created at":7,"Expires at <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.\"></i>":8,"Completed at":9,"Errors":10,"Batch Item Detail of":11,"ID":12,"Completed on":13,"Model":14,"Prompt Token":15,"Completion Token":16,"Total Token":17,"Status Code":18,"error":19,"Conversation":20,"Response Validation":21,"Raw Payload":22,"View raw payload":23,"Response Preview":24,"Apply translations from selected rows":25,"Here you can edit the translation result individually and send it into Translator++":26,"Open ChatGPT Settings":27,"Help":28,"File list":29,"Collapse / restore left panel":30,"Batches that do not complete in time eventually move to an expired state; unfinished requests within that batch are cancelled, and any responses to completed requests are made available via the batch's output file. You will be charged for tokens consumed from any completed requests.":31},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/chatgpt-batch-manager/index.html","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":32,"length":32,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/transOpenAIAssistant.js":{"data":[["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>標題：遊戲的標題</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>引擎：遊戲的引擎</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>","<li>角色資訊：角色資訊的詞彙表。（僅在批次模式中啟用角色資訊選項時）</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>參考[物件名稱]：從Translator++物件生成參考。<br />範例：<code>參考[通用參考]</code></li>"],["<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>","<li>上下文：先前翻譯的上下文（如果啟用上下文）</li>"],["Sample conversation","範例對話"],["<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>範例對話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>現有的範例對話。您可以撰寫好或壞回應的範例，以幫助翻譯者理解您的目標和對話的上下文。</p>"],["Always separate file","總是分開檔案"],["Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.","總是為每個批次分開檔案。這可以保持每個檔案的上下文不受其他檔案的污染。"],["Add actor name","添加角色名稱"],["Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.","從行資訊中附加角色名稱到可翻譯文本。這將幫助翻譯者追蹤對話和代名詞。Translator++隨後會從翻譯結果中移除角色名稱。這顯然會增加翻譯成本。"],["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","載入角色參考作為詞彙表"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","如果勾選，Translator++將載入角色參考作為詞彙表。這將幫助翻譯者理解對話的上下文。角色參考是對話中角色的名稱。這將作為詞彙表載入到翻譯者。這會增加翻譯成本。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","只有存在於對話中的角色才會為每個批次項目載入為詞彙表。使用模板命令在提示訊息中載入角色參考。"],["<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.","<br />⚠️如果您啟用此選項，還需要在提示模板中包含<code>角色資訊</code>變數來放置角色資訊數據。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","角色參考翻譯欄位"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","角色名稱翻譯的欄位。此欄位將用作角色參考的翻譯。這將提高對話中角色名稱翻譯的一致性。"],["Actor's Information Column","角色資訊欄位"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","包含角色額外資訊的欄位。您可以放入更多資訊，如性別、年齡等。這將提高對話中代名詞的翻譯。"],["Extra Prompt","額外提示"],["Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.","將添加到提示訊息中的額外提示。這將在系統訊息之後、實際提示訊息之前添加。"],["General Settings","一般設定"],["Always separate file for each batch","每個批次始終使用單獨檔案"],["Append actor name to the translatable text","將演員名稱附加到可翻譯文本"],["Glossary","詞彙表"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>詞彙表</h2>"],["<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>","<p>此功能將幫助您自動將詞彙表添加到提示中。詞彙表將為每個批次項目加載，以提高翻譯質量。該功能將嘗試僅加載相關術語，以避免提示過於臃腫。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","演員附加資訊欄位"],["Prompt","提示"]],"context":[["tid/778/type/StringLiteral","tid/4939/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/786/type/StringLiteral","tid/4947/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/794/type/StringLiteral","tid/4955/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/802/type/StringLiteral","tid/4963/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/810/type/StringLiteral","tid/4971/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/879/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2626/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2633/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4657/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4691/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4701/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4738/type/StringLiteral","tid/5148/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4762/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4796/type/StringLiteral","tid/5179/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4806/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4833/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4843/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4873/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4883/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5010/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5036/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5060/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5092/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5118/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5125/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5210/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5241/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"transOpenAIAssistant.js","dirname":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch","extension":".js","filename":"transOpenAIAssistant.js","path":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/transOpenAIAssistant.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":0,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":1,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Glossary of actor information.(Only if actor information option is enabled in batch mode)</li>":2,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":3,"<li>CONTEXT : Context of the previous translation (if context is enabled)</li>":4,"Sample conversation":5,"<h2>Sample dialogue</h2>":6,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":7,"Always separate file":8,"Always separate the file for each batch. This may keep the contexts of each files unpoluted with another files.":9,"Add actor name":10,"Append actor name from row info to the translatable text. This will help the translators to keep track of the dialogue and pronouns. Translator++ will then removes the actor name from the translation result. This obviously will increase the cost of the translation.":11,"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":12,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":13,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":14,"<br />⚠️If you enable this option, you also need to include the <code>ACTOR_INFO</code> variable in the prompt template to place the character information data.":15,"Actor Reference Translation Column":16,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":17,"Actor's Information Column":18,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":19,"Extra Prompt":20,"Extra prompt that will be added to the prompt message. This will be added after the system message and before the actual prompt message.":21,"General Settings":22,"Always separate file for each batch":23,"Append actor name to the translatable text":24,"Glossary":25,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":26,"<p>This feature will help you automatically add a glossary into the prompt. The glossary will be loaded for each batch of items to improve the quality of the translation. The feature will try to load only the relevant terms to avoid bloating your prompt.</p>":27,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":28,"Prompt":29},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/transOpenAIAssistant.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":30,"length":30,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/utility.js":{"data":[["Batch Manager","批次管理器"],["This feature is only available if you have a project open.","此功能僅在您有開啟專案時可用。"]],"context":[["tid/78/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/114/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"utility.js","dirname":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch","extension":".js","filename":"utility.js","path":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/utility.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Batch Manager":0,"This feature is only available if you have a project open.":1},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transOpenAIBatch/utility.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":2,"length":2,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transPyTranslators/pyTranslators.js":{"data":[["Start server","啟動伺服器"],["Server started","伺服器已啟動"],["Reinstall server","重新安裝伺服器"],["Enter the new version of Translators library you wish to install.\nLatest version is: ","請輸入您希望安裝的Translators庫新版本。\n最新版本是："],["Are you sure you want to install Translators version ","您確定要安裝Translators版本"],["Failed to install Translators. Please check the console for more details.","安裝Translators失敗。請檢查控制台以獲取更多詳細資訊。"],["Translators has been successfully updated to version ","Translators已成功更新至版本"],["General Settings","一般設定"]],"context":[["tid/2096/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2192/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2241/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2480/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2555/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2574/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3019/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"pyTranslators.js","dirname":"/addons/transPyTranslators","extension":".js","filename":"pyTranslators.js","path":"/addons/transPyTranslators/pyTranslators.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Start server":0,"Server started":1,"Reinstall server":2,"Enter the new version of Translators library you wish to install.\nLatest version is: ":3,"Are you sure you want to install Translators version ":4,"Failed to install Translators. Please check the console for more details.":5,"Translators has been successfully updated to version ":6,"General Settings":7},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transPyTranslators/pyTranslators.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":8,"length":8,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transRedBatch/transredbatch.js":{"data":[["Are you sure you want to abort?","您確定要中止嗎？"],["Process paused!\nPress OK to continue!","處理已暫停！\n按確定以繼續！"]],"context":[["tid/2002/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2070/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"transredbatch.js","dirname":"/addons/transRedBatch","extension":".js","filename":"transredbatch.js","path":"/addons/transRedBatch/transredbatch.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Are you sure you want to abort?":0,"Process paused!\nPress OK to continue!":1},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transRedBatch/transredbatch.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":2,"length":2,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/transRikaikun/transRikaikun.js":{"data":[["Never unload dictionaries from RAM","永不從RAM卸載字典"]],"context":[["tid/890/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"transRikaikun.js","dirname":"/addons/transRikaikun","extension":".js","filename":"transRikaikun.js","path":"/addons/transRikaikun/transRikaikun.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Never unload dictionaries from RAM":0},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/transRikaikun/transRikaikun.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":1,"length":1,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/translationProxy/translationProxy.js":{"data":[["Cannot start Translation Proxy!\nTranslation Proxy is currently only available for $3 or more patrons.","無法啟動翻譯代理！\n翻譯代理目前僅適用於$3或以上的贊助者。"],["Please enter the port number:","請輸入端口號碼："],["Invalid port : ","無效的端口："],["Port must be a numeric.","端口必須為數字。"],["Port has successfully changed to: ","端口已成功更改為："],["Connection Info","連接資訊"],["Do you want to copy the base URL into the clipboard?","您要將基礎URL複製到剪貼簿嗎？"],["Use secure protocol(HTTPS)","使用安全協議(HTTPS)"],["Port","端口"],["Connection info","連接資訊"],["Help","說明"]],"context":[["tid/3919/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4030/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4063/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4072/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4104/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4236/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4252/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4490/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4575/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4627/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4664/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"translationProxy.js","dirname":"/addons/translationProxy","extension":".js","filename":"translationProxy.js","path":"/addons/translationProxy/translationProxy.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Cannot start Translation Proxy!\nTranslation Proxy is currently only available for $3 or more patrons.":0,"Please enter the port number:":1,"Invalid port : ":2,"Port must be a numeric.":3,"Port has successfully changed to: ":4,"Connection Info":5,"Do you want to copy the base URL into the clipboard?":6,"Use secure protocol(HTTPS)":7,"Port":8,"Connection info":9,"Help":10},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/translationProxy/translationProxy.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":11,"length":11,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/tyranoTrans/tyranoTrans.js":{"data":[["Will force the text encoding into the one selected when writing the scripts. (blank = auto)<br />. You can use this field to convert the script into <b>UTF-16</b> so that the game will playable without changing your locale into Japanese.","將強制將文字編碼轉換為寫入腳本時所選的編碼。（空白 = 自動）<br />您可以使用此欄位將腳本轉換為<b>UTF-16</b>，這樣遊戲就能在不更改地區設定為日文的情況下遊玩。"],["Use legacy parser","使用舊版解析器"],["Use legacy (old parser) instead of the new parser.<br />Legacy parser is faster, but unreliable on some game.<br />New parser is more reliable, but slower.","使用舊版（舊解析器）而非新解析器。<br />舊版解析器較快，但在某些遊戲中不可靠。<br />新版解析器更可靠，但較慢。"],["Select TyranoBuilder packaged game","選擇 TyranoBuilder 打包遊戲"],["Select the exe file of your packaged game.","選擇您打包遊戲的 exe 檔案。"],["Target folder","目標資料夾"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","選擇目標資料夾。此過程將替換現有檔案。"],["Extraction completed","擷取完成"],["Close","關閉"],["Next","下一步"],["Please select game executable file","請選擇遊戲執行檔"],["Back","返回"],["The game is fully loaded, proceed!","遊戲已完全載入，請繼續！"],["Extract data","擷取資料"],["Open extracted folder","開啟擷取資料夾"],["Extract resources","擷取資源"],["Select the game executable","選擇遊戲執行檔"],["Select the game executable or asar file to extract","選擇要擷取的遊戲執行檔或 asar 檔案"],["Target directory","目標目錄"],["Select the target directory to store the unpacked files","選擇目標目錄以儲存解壓縮的檔案"],["Electron archive file detected. Do you want to extract the asar file instead?","偵測到 Electron 封存檔案。您是否要改為解壓縮 asar 檔案？"],["Tyranobuilder Game Extractor","Tyranobuilder 遊戲解壓縮器"],["Before you create a new project, please make sure that :","在創建新專案之前，請確保："],["<b>Kirikiri Adventure Game parser</b> add-on is installed in your Translator++","<b>Kirikiri 冒險遊戲解析器</b> 附加元件已安裝在您的 Translator++ 中"],["Your game is fully extracted.","您的遊戲已完全解壓縮。"],["Extract TyranoBuilder package","解壓縮 TyranoBuilder 套件"],["All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)","所有 .ks 和 .tjs 檔案都是純文字（未編譯、未加擾、未加密）"],["Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>","某些操作會修改您的遊戲。<b>因此請務必創建遊戲的備份！</b>"],["Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.","選擇遊戲執行檔案。此檔案是將用於提取遊戲資料的主要遊戲檔案。"],["In Tyrano games it is usually <b>index.html</b> or <b>exe</b> file.","在 Tyrano 遊戲中，通常是 <b>index.html</b> 或 <b>exe</b> 檔案。"],["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.","可能的字元編碼列表。<b>順序很重要！</b> 您可以拖曳以排序列表。"],["Game created with TyranoBuilder is in <b>UTF-8</b> encoding","使用 TyranoBuilder 創建的遊戲採用 <b>UTF-8</b> 編碼"],["Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.","字面標籤是將在 Translator++ 編輯器中轉義的標籤。"],["<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.","<b>ruby l r</b> 是必需的。"],["<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.","<b>[r]</b> 標籤將由 Translator++ 插值為新行。因此您不需要明確寫入 <b>[r]</b>。"],["Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.","Kirikiri 腳本 (.ks) 高度可自訂，允許開發者創建自己的標籤。"],["Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).","Translator++ 可以處理標準標籤，例如以井號 (#) 開頭的角色名稱。"],["However, Translator++ may not be able to handle custom tags created by developers.","然而，Translator++ 可能無法處理開發者創建的自訂標籤。"],["Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.","因此，您可能需要定義需要翻譯的標籤和屬性，以及需要標記為演員名稱的標籤和屬性。"],["<p>Please visit the <a href=\"https://tyranobuilder.com/tag/\" external target=\"_blank\">TyranoBuilder tag reference</a> for more information about the tags.</p>","<p>請訪問 <a href=\"https://tyranobuilder.com/tag/\" external target=\"_blank\">TyranoBuilder 標籤參考</a> 以獲取有關標籤的更多資訊。</p>"],["You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.tyranoTrans.TyranoUtil.showExtractDialog()\" /> and analyze the <b>ks</b> script inside it before starting the project.","在開始專案前，您可能需要 <input type=\"button\" value=\"提取您的遊戲\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.tyranoTrans.TyranoUtil.showExtractDialog()\" /> 並分析其中的 <b>ks</b> 腳本。"],["Create Project","創建專案"],["Play last build","播放最後構建"],["Extract TyranoBuilder","提取 TyranoBuilder"],["Create playable package","創建可播放套件"]],"context":[["tid/74/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/249/type/StringLiteral","tid/259/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/269/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4537/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4739/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4744/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4877/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4970/type/StringLiteral","tid/5392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5053/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/5103/type/StringLiteral","tid/5199/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5146/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5242/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5334/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5476/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5750/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5760/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5793/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5803/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5992/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6081/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9405/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9415/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9420/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9425/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9430/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9636/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9645/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9694/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9738/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9747/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10111/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10118/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10125/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10132/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10139/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/10146/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12059/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12121/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12176/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tyranoTrans.js","dirname":"/addons/tyranoTrans","extension":".js","filename":"tyranoTrans.js","path":"/addons/tyranoTrans/tyranoTrans.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Will force the text encoding into the one selected when writing the scripts. (blank = auto)<br />. You can use this field to convert the script into <b>UTF-16</b> so that the game will playable without changing your locale into Japanese.":0,"Use legacy parser":1,"Use legacy (old parser) instead of the new parser.<br />Legacy parser is faster, but unreliable on some game.<br />New parser is more reliable, but slower.":2,"Select TyranoBuilder packaged game":3,"Select the exe file of your packaged game.":4,"Target folder":5,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":6,"Extraction completed":7,"Close":8,"Next":9,"Please select game executable file":10,"Back":11,"The game is fully loaded, proceed!":12,"Extract data":13,"Open extracted folder":14,"Extract resources":15,"Select the game executable":16,"Select the game executable or asar file to extract":17,"Target directory":18,"Select the target directory to store the unpacked files":19,"Electron archive file detected. Do you want to extract the asar file instead?":20,"Tyranobuilder Game Extractor":21,"Before you create a new project, please make sure that :":22,"<b>Kirikiri Adventure Game parser</b> add-on is installed in your Translator++":23,"Your game is fully extracted.":24,"Extract TyranoBuilder package":25,"All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)":26,"Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>":27,"Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.":28,"In Tyrano games it is usually <b>index.html</b> or <b>exe</b> file.":29,"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.":30,"Game created with TyranoBuilder is in <b>UTF-8</b> encoding":31,"Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.":32,"<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.":33,"<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.":34,"Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.":35,"Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).":36,"However, Translator++ may not be able to handle custom tags created by developers.":37,"Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.":38,"<p>Please visit the <a href=\"https://tyranobuilder.com/tag/\" external target=\"_blank\">TyranoBuilder tag reference</a> for more information about the tags.</p>":39,"You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.tyranoTrans.TyranoUtil.showExtractDialog()\" /> and analyze the <b>ks</b> script inside it before starting the project.":40,"Create Project":41,"Play last build":42,"Extract TyranoBuilder":43,"Create playable package":44},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/tyranoTrans/tyranoTrans.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":45,"length":45,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/unityTrans/configEdit.html":{"data":[["General","一般"],["Executable file location","可執行檔案位置"],["\n\t\t\t\tPath to the application's executable file.\n\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t應用程式可執行檔案的路徑。\n\t\t\t"],["Field can not be empty!","欄位不能為空！"],["Service","服務"],["End Point","端點"],["Auto translation service to use.","要使用的自動翻譯服務。"],["Target Language","目標語言"],["The language to translate into","要翻譯成的語言"],["Source Language","來源語言"],["The original language of the game. \"auto\" is also supported for some endpoints, but it is generally not recommended","遊戲的原始語言。某些端點也支援「自動」，但通常不建議使用"],["Files","檔案"],["Directory","目錄"],["Directory to search for cached translation files. Can use placeholder: {GameExeName}, {Lang}","搜尋快取翻譯檔案的目錄。可使用佔位符：{GameExeName}、{Lang}"],["Output File","輸出檔案"],["File to insert generated translations into. Can use placeholders: {GameExeName}, {Lang}","要插入生成翻譯的檔案。可使用佔位符：{GameExeName}、{Lang}"],["Substitution File","替換檔案"],["File that contains substitution applied before translations. Can use placeholders: {GameExeName}, {Lang}","包含在翻譯前應用的替換的檔案。可使用佔位符：{GameExeName}、{Lang}"],["Preprocessors File","預處理器檔案"],["File that contains preprocessors to be applied before sending a text to a translator. Can use placeholders: {GameExeName}, {Lang}","包含在發送文本給翻譯器前應用的預處理器的檔案。可使用佔位符：{GameExeName}、{Lang}"],["Text Frameworks","文本框架"],["Enable/Disable auto translation for Unity's text frameworks.","啟用/停用 Unity 文本框架的自動翻譯。"],["Behaviour","行為"],["Max Characters Per Translation","每次翻譯最大字元數"],["Max characters per text to translate. Max 2500.","每次翻譯文本的最大字元數。上限 2500。"],["Whether or not to ignore whitespace, including newlines, in dialogue keys","是否忽略對話鍵中的空白字元（包括換行）"],["Whether or not to ignore whitespace, including newlines, in NGUI","是否忽略 NGUI 中的空白字元（包括換行）"],["Minimum Dialogue Chars","最小對話字元數"],["The length of the text for it to be considered a dialogue","文本被視為對話的長度"],["Force Split Text After Characters","強制在字元後分割文本"],["Split text into multiple lines once the translated text exceeds this number of characters. (0 is no split)","一旦翻譯文本超過此字元數，將文本分割成多行。（0 表示不分割）"],["Whether or not to copy hooked texts to clipboard","是否將掛鉤的文本複製到剪貼簿"],["MaxClipboardCopyCharacters","最大剪貼簿複製字元數"],["Max number of characters to hook to clipboard at a time","每次掛鉤到剪貼簿的最大字元數"],["Whether or not the plugin should provide a \"best attempt\" at resizing UI components upon translation","插件是否應在翻譯時對UI元件提供「最佳嘗試」的調整大小"],["Indicates whether batching of translations should be enabled for supported endpoints","指示是否應為支援的端點啟用翻譯批次處理"],["Indicates whether or not to use translations from the included static translation cache","指示是否使用包含的靜態翻譯快取中的翻譯"],["Override Font","覆蓋字體"],["Overrides the fonts used for texts when updating text components. NOTE: Only works for UGUI","更新文字元件時覆蓋用於文字的字體。注意：僅適用於UGUI"],["Override Font TextMeshPro","覆蓋字體TextMeshPro"],["Overrides the fonts used for texts when updating text components. NOTE: Only works for TextMeshPro","更新文字元件時覆蓋用於文字的字體。注意：僅適用於TextMeshPro"],["Resize UI Line Spacing Scale","調整UI行間距比例"],["A decimal value that the default line spacing should be scaled by during UI resizing, for example: 0.80. NOTE: Only works for UGUI","在UI調整大小期間，預設行間距應縮放的十進制值，例如：0.80。注意：僅適用於UGUI"],["Indicates whether the UI resize behavior should be applied to all UI components regardless of them being translated.","指示UI調整大小行為是否應應用於所有UI元件，無論它們是否被翻譯"],["Ignore Text Starting With","忽略以特定字符開頭的文字"],["Indicates that the plugin should ignore any strings starting with certain characters. This is a list seperated by ';'.","指示插件應忽略以某些字符開頭的任何字串。這是一個以';'分隔的清單"],["Indicates whether or not to enable \"Text Getter Compatibility Mode\". Should only be enabled if required by the game.","指示是否啟用「文字獲取器相容模式」。僅在遊戲需要時才應啟用"],["GameLog Text Paths","遊戲日誌文字路徑"],["Indicates specific paths for game objects that the game uses as \"log components\", where it continuously appends or prepends text to. Requires expert knowledge to setup. This is a list seperated by ';'.","指示遊戲用作「日誌元件」的遊戲物件的特定路徑，其中持續附加或前置文字。需要專家知識來設置。這是一個以';'分隔的清單"],["Romaji Post Processing","羅馬字後處理"],["Indicates what type of post processing to do on 'translated' romaji texts. This can be important in certain games because the font used does not support various diacritics properly. This is a list seperated by ';'. Possible values: [\"RemoveAllDiacritics\", \"ReplaceMacronWithCircumflex\", \"RemoveApostrophes\"]","指示對「已翻譯」羅馬字文字進行何種類型的後處理。這在某些遊戲中很重要，因為使用的字體不正確支援各種變音符號。這是一個以';'分隔的清單。可能值：[\"移除所有變音符號\", \"用抑揚符替換長音符\", \"移除撇號\"]"],["Translation Post Processing","翻譯後處理"],["Indicates what type of post processing to do on translated texts (not romaji). Possible values: [\"RemoveAllDiacritics\", \"ReplaceMacronWithCircumflex\", \"RemoveApostrophes\", \"ReplaceWideCharacters\"]","指示對已翻譯文字（非羅馬字）進行何種類型的後處理。可能值：[\"移除所有變音符號\", \"用抑揚符替換長音符\", \"移除撇號\", \"替換全形字符\"]"],["Indicates whether or not results of regex lookups should be output to the specified OutputFile.","指示是否應將正則表達式查找的結果輸出到指定的輸出檔案"],["Indicates whether or not whitespace differences should be output to the specified OutputFile.","指示是否應將空白差異輸出到指定的輸出檔案。"],["Indicates whether or not the complete result of regex-splitted translations should be output to the specified OutputFile.","指示是否應將正則表達式分割翻譯的完整結果輸出到指定的輸出檔案。"],["Indicates that the plugin should generate translations without variables when using substitutions.","指示插件在使用替換時應生成不含變數的翻譯。"],["Indicates that the plugin should generate partial translations to support text translations as it is \"scrolling in\".","指示插件應生成部分翻譯，以支持文本在「滾動進入」時的翻譯。"],["Indicates the plugin should parse 'TARC' directives and scope translations based on these.","指示插件應解析 'TARC' 指令並基於這些指令限定翻譯範圍。"],["Indicates the plugin should not print out success messages in relation to translations.","指示插件不應輸出與翻譯相關的成功訊息。"],["Blacklisted IMGUI Plugins","黑名單 IMGUI 插件"],["If an IMGUI window assembly/class/method name contains any of the strings in this list (case insensitive) that UI will not be translated. Requires MonoMod hooks. This is a list seperated by ';'","如果 IMGUI 視窗組件/類別/方法名稱包含此列表中的任何字串（不區分大小寫），該 UI 將不會被翻譯。需要 MonoMod 鉤子。這是一個以 ';' 分隔的列表。"],["Indicates if texts that are considered by the plugin to be untranslatable should be output to the specified OutputFile.","指示插件認為不可翻譯的文本是否應輸出到指定的輸出檔案。"],["Indicates that rules for virtual method calls should be ignored when trying to set the text of a text component. May in some cases help setting the text of stubborn components.","指示在嘗試設置文本組件的文本時應忽略虛擬方法調用的規則。在某些情況下可能有助於設置頑固組件的文本。"],["Max Text Parser Recursion","最大文本解析器遞歸"],["Indicates how many levels of recursion are allowed when text is parsed so it can be translated in different parts. This can be used with splitter-regexes in advanced scenarios. The default value of one essentially means that recursion is disabled.","指示在解析文本以進行不同部分翻譯時允許的遞歸層級。這可用於高級場景中的分割正則表達式。預設值為一，基本上意味著遞歸被禁用。"],["Will preprocess and decode html entities before they are send for translation. Some translators will fail when html entities are sent.","在發送翻譯前將預處理和解碼 HTML 實體。某些翻譯器在發送 HTML 實體時會失敗。"],["Will enable automated handling of rich text (text with markup).","將啟用富文本（帶有標記的文本）的自動處理。"],["Indicates if translator-related helpful log messages should be enabled. May be useful when tranlating based on redirected resources.","指示是否應啟用與翻譯相關的有用日誌訊息。在基於重定向資源進行翻譯時可能有用。"],["Indicates that the plugin must use MonoMod hooks instead of harmony hooks.","指示插件必須使用 MonoMod 鉤子而非 Harmony 鉤子。"],["Indicates the plugin should initial harmony detour bridge which allows harmony hooks to work in an environment where System.Reflection.Emit does not exist (usually such settings are handled by plugin managers, so don't use when using a plugin manager).","指示插件應初始化 Harmony 繞道橋，允許 Harmony 鉤子在 System.Reflection.Emit 不存在的環境中工作（通常此類設置由插件管理器處理，因此在使用插件管理器時請勿使用）。"],["Redirected Resource Detection Strategy","重定向資源檢測策略"],["Indicates if and how the plugin should attempt to recognize redirected resources in order to prevent double translations.","指示插件是否以及如何嘗試識別重定向資源以防止雙重翻譯。"],["Indicates if the plugin should output text that exceeds <b>'Max Characters Per Translation'</b> without translating it.","指示插件是否應輸出超過 <b>'每次翻譯最大字符數'</b> 的文本而不翻譯它。"],["Texture","紋理"],["Texture Directory","紋理目錄"],["Directory to dump textures to, and root of directories to load images from. Can use placeholder: {GameExeName}, {Lang}","用於導出紋理的目錄，以及載入圖像的根目錄。可使用佔位符：{GameExeName}、{Lang}"],["Indicates whether the plugin will attempt to replace in-game images with those from the TextureDirectory directory.","指示插件是否會嘗試用來自TextureDirectory目錄的圖像替換遊戲內圖像。"],["Indicates whether the plugin will dump texture it is capable of replacing to the TextureDirectory. Has significant performance impact.","指示插件是否會將能夠替換的紋理導出到TextureDirectory。對性能有顯著影響。"],["Indicates whether or not toggling the translation with the ALT+T hotkey will also affect textures. Not guaranteed to work for all textures. Has significant performance impact.","指示使用ALT+T熱鍵切換翻譯時是否也會影響紋理。不保證適用於所有紋理。對性能有顯著影響。"],["Indicates whether or not the plugin should scan for textures on scene load. This enables the plugin to find and (possibly) replace more texture.","指示插件是否應在場景載入時掃描紋理。這使插件能夠找到並（可能）替換更多紋理。"],["Indicates whether or not the plugin should attempt to hook SpriteRenderer. This is a seperate option because SpriteRenderer can't actually be hooked properly and the implemented workaround could have a theoretical impact on performance in certain situations.","指示插件是否應嘗試掛鉤SpriteRenderer。這是一個單獨選項，因為SpriteRenderer實際上無法正確掛鉤，且實現的解決方案在某些情況下可能對性能有理論上的影響。"],["Indicates whether or not unmodified textures should be loaded. Modifications are determined based on the hash in the file name. Only enable this for debugging purposes as it is likely to cause oddities.","指示是否應載入未修改的紋理。修改基於檔案名稱中的雜湊值確定。僅在調試時啟用此選項，因為它可能導致異常。"],["Texture Hash Generation Strategy","紋理雜湊生成策略"],["Indicates how the mod identifies pictures through hashes.","指示模組如何透過雜湊識別圖片。"],["Duplicate Texture Names","重複紋理名稱"],["Indicates specific texture names that are duplicated in the game. List is separated by ';'","指示遊戲中重複的特定紋理名稱。列表以';'分隔"],["Indicates if the plugin should detect duplicate texture names.","指示插件是否應檢測重複的紋理名稱。"],["Indicates the plugin should use a different strategy to load images, that may be relevant if the game engine is old.","指示插件應使用不同的策略載入圖像，這可能與遊戲引擎較舊相關。"],["Indicates that all textures loaded should be kept in memory for optimal performance. Disable to decrease memory usage.","指示所有載入的紋理應保留在記憶體中以獲得最佳性能。禁用此選項可減少記憶體使用量。"],["Resource Redirector","資源重定向器"],["Preferred Storage Path","首選儲存路徑"],["Indicates the preferred storage for redirected resources in relation to the Auto Translator. Can use placeholder: {GameExeName}, {Lang}","指示相對於自動翻譯器的重定向資源的首選儲存位置。可使用佔位符：{GameExeName}、{Lang}"],["Indicates if TextAssets should be redirected","指示是否應重定向TextAssets"],["Indicates if the plugin should log to the console all loaded assets. Useful to determine what can be hooked","指示插件是否應將所有載入的資產記錄到控制台。有助於確定哪些可以掛鉤"],["Indicates if translatable resources that are found should be dumped","指示是否應傾印找到的可翻譯資源"],["When files are in ZIP files in the PreferredStoragePath, these files are indexed in memory to avoid performing file check IO when loading them. Enabling this option will do the same for physical files","當檔案位於PreferredStoragePath中的ZIP檔案時，這些檔案會在記憶體中建立索引，以避免載入時執行檔案檢查IO。啟用此選項將對實體檔案執行相同操作"],["HTTP","HTTP"],["User Agent","使用者代理"],["Override the user agent used by APIs requiring a user agent","覆蓋需要使用者代理的API所使用的使用者代理"],["Indiciates whether certificate validations for the .NET API should be disabled","指示是否應禁用.NET API的憑證驗證"],["Translation Aggregator","翻譯聚合器"],["Width","寬度"],["The total width of the translation aggregator window","翻譯聚合器視窗的總寬度"],["Height","高度"],["The width (per translator) of the translation aggregator window.","翻譯聚合器視窗的寬度（每個翻譯器）。"],["Enabled Translators","啟用的翻譯器"],["The id's of the translation endpoints that has been enabled in the translation aggregator window. List is separated by ';'","翻譯聚合器視窗中已啟用的翻譯端點的ID。列表以';'分隔"],["Google","Google"],["ServiceUrl","服務網址"],["OPTIONAL, can be used to direct google API request to a different URL. Can be used to circumvent GFWoC","可選，可用於將Google API請求導向不同的URL。可用於繞過GFWoC"],["Google Legitimate","Google合法"],["Google API Key","Google API金鑰"],["OPTIONAL, needed if GoogleTranslateLegitimate is configured","可選，如果配置了GoogleTranslateLegitimate則需要"],["Bing Legitimate","Bing 合法"],["OcpApim Subscription Key","OcpApim 訂閱金鑰"],["OPTIONAL, needed if BingTranslateLegitimate is configured","可選，若配置了 BingTranslateLegitimate 則需要"],["Baidu","百度"],["Baidu App Id","百度應用程式 ID"],["OPTIONAL, needed if BaiduTranslate is configured","可選，若配置了 BaiduTranslate 則需要"],["BaiduAppSecret","百度應用程式密鑰"],["Yandex","Yandex"],["Yandex API Key","Yandex API 金鑰"],["OPTIONAL, needed if YandexTranslate is configured","可選，若配置了 YandexTranslate 則需要"],["Watson","Watson"],["Url","網址"],["OPTIONAL, needed if WatsonTranslate is configured","可選，若配置了 WatsonTranslate 則需要"],["Key","金鑰"],["DeepL","DeepL"],["MinDelay","最小延遲"],["OPTIONAL, used for throttling DeepL","可選，用於節流 DeepL"],["MaxDelay","最大延遲"],["DeepL Legitimate","DeepL 合法"],["OPTIONAL, required if DeepLLegitimate is configured","可選，若配置了 DeepLLegitimate 則需要"],["Custom","自訂"],["Optional, needed if Custom Translated is configured","可選，若配置了自訂翻譯則需要"],["Lec Power Translator 15","Lec Power Translator 15"],["InstallationPath","安裝路徑"],["Optional, needed if Lec Power Translator 15 is configured","可選，若配置了 Lec Power Translator 15 則需要"],["Debug","除錯"],["Enables the console. Do not enable if other plugins (managers) handles this","啟用控制台。如果其他插件（管理器）處理此功能，請勿啟用"],["Enables extra logging for debugging purposes","啟用額外日誌記錄以進行除錯"],["ezTrans","ezTrans"],["Installation Path of ezTrans.","ezTrans 的安裝路徑"],["Migrations","遷移"],["Used to enable automatic migrations of this configuration file","用於啟用此配置檔案的自動遷移"],["Tag","標籤"],["Tag representing the last version this plugin was executed under. Do not edit","代表此插件上次執行的版本標籤。請勿編輯"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText","idx/7/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/29/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/46/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/48/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/50/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/52/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/54/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/56/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/58/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/60/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/62/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/64/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/66/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/68/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/72/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/74/innerText"],["idx/75/innerText"],["idx/76/innerText"],["idx/77/innerText"],["idx/78/innerText"],["idx/79/innerText"],["idx/80/innerText"],["idx/81/innerText"],["idx/82/innerText"],["idx/83/innerText"],["idx/84/innerText"],["idx/85/innerText"],["idx/86/innerText"],["idx/87/innerText"],["idx/88/innerText"],["idx/89/innerText"],["idx/90/innerText"],["idx/91/innerText"],["idx/92/innerText"],["idx/93/innerText"],["idx/94/innerText"],["idx/95/innerText"],["idx/96/innerText"],["idx/97/innerText"],["idx/99/innerText"],["idx/100/innerText"],["idx/101/innerText"],["idx/102/innerText"],["idx/103/innerText"],["idx/104/innerText"],["idx/105/innerText"],["idx/106/innerText"],["idx/107/innerText"],["idx/108/innerText"],["idx/109/innerText"],["idx/110/innerText"],["idx/111/innerText"],["idx/112/innerText"],["idx/113/innerText"],["idx/114/innerText"],["idx/115/innerText"],["idx/116/innerText"],["idx/117/innerText"],["idx/118/innerText"],["idx/119/innerText"],["idx/120/innerText"],["idx/121/innerText"],["idx/122/innerText"],["idx/123/innerText"],["idx/124/innerText"],["idx/125/innerText"],["idx/126/innerText"],["idx/127/innerText"],["idx/128/innerText","idx/130/innerText"],["idx/129/innerText"],["idx/131/innerText"],["idx/132/innerText"],["idx/133/innerText"],["idx/134/innerText"],["idx/135/innerText","idx/149/innerText"],["idx/136/innerText","idx/138/innerText"],["idx/137/innerText"],["idx/139/innerText"],["idx/140/innerText","idx/145/innerText"],["idx/141/innerText","idx/143/innerText"],["idx/142/innerText"],["idx/144/innerText"],["idx/146/innerText","idx/147/innerText"],["idx/148/innerText"],["idx/150/innerText"],["idx/151/innerText"],["idx/152/innerText","idx/158/innerText"],["idx/153/innerText"],["idx/154/innerText"],["idx/155/innerText"],["idx/156/innerText"],["idx/157/innerText"],["idx/159/innerText"],["idx/160/innerText"],["idx/161/innerText"],["idx/162/innerText"],["idx/163/innerText"]],"basename":"configEdit.html","dirname":"/addons/unityTrans","extension":".html","filename":"configEdit.html","path":"/addons/unityTrans/configEdit.html","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"General":0,"Executable file location":1,"\n\t\t\t\tPath to the application's executable file.\n\t\t\t":2,"Field can not be empty!":3,"Service":4,"End Point":5,"Auto translation service to use.":6,"Target Language":7,"The language to translate into":8,"Source Language":9,"The original language of the game. \"auto\" is also supported for some endpoints, but it is generally not recommended":10,"Files":11,"Directory":12,"Directory to search for cached translation files. Can use placeholder: {GameExeName}, {Lang}":13,"Output File":14,"File to insert generated translations into. Can use placeholders: {GameExeName}, {Lang}":15,"Substitution File":16,"File that contains substitution applied before translations. Can use placeholders: {GameExeName}, {Lang}":17,"Preprocessors File":18,"File that contains preprocessors to be applied before sending a text to a translator. Can use placeholders: {GameExeName}, {Lang}":19,"Text Frameworks":20,"Enable/Disable auto translation for Unity's text frameworks.":21,"Behaviour":22,"Max Characters Per Translation":23,"Max characters per text to translate. Max 2500.":24,"Whether or not to ignore whitespace, including newlines, in dialogue keys":25,"Whether or not to ignore whitespace, including newlines, in NGUI":26,"Minimum Dialogue Chars":27,"The length of the text for it to be considered a dialogue":28,"Force Split Text After Characters":29,"Split text into multiple lines once the translated text exceeds this number of characters. (0 is no split)":30,"Whether or not to copy hooked texts to clipboard":31,"MaxClipboardCopyCharacters":32,"Max number of characters to hook to clipboard at a time":33,"Whether or not the plugin should provide a \"best attempt\" at resizing UI components upon translation":34,"Indicates whether batching of translations should be enabled for supported endpoints":35,"Indicates whether or not to use translations from the included static translation cache":36,"Override Font":37,"Overrides the fonts used for texts when updating text components. NOTE: Only works for UGUI":38,"Override Font TextMeshPro":39,"Overrides the fonts used for texts when updating text components. NOTE: Only works for TextMeshPro":40,"Resize UI Line Spacing Scale":41,"A decimal value that the default line spacing should be scaled by during UI resizing, for example: 0.80. NOTE: Only works for UGUI":42,"Indicates whether the UI resize behavior should be applied to all UI components regardless of them being translated.":43,"Ignore Text Starting With":44,"Indicates that the plugin should ignore any strings starting with certain characters. This is a list seperated by ';'.":45,"Indicates whether or not to enable \"Text Getter Compatibility Mode\". Should only be enabled if required by the game.":46,"GameLog Text Paths":47,"Indicates specific paths for game objects that the game uses as \"log components\", where it continuously appends or prepends text to. Requires expert knowledge to setup. This is a list seperated by ';'.":48,"Romaji Post Processing":49,"Indicates what type of post processing to do on 'translated' romaji texts. This can be important in certain games because the font used does not support various diacritics properly. This is a list seperated by ';'. Possible values: [\"RemoveAllDiacritics\", \"ReplaceMacronWithCircumflex\", \"RemoveApostrophes\"]":50,"Translation Post Processing":51,"Indicates what type of post processing to do on translated texts (not romaji). Possible values: [\"RemoveAllDiacritics\", \"ReplaceMacronWithCircumflex\", \"RemoveApostrophes\", \"ReplaceWideCharacters\"]":52,"Indicates whether or not results of regex lookups should be output to the specified OutputFile.":53,"Indicates whether or not whitespace differences should be output to the specified OutputFile.":54,"Indicates whether or not the complete result of regex-splitted translations should be output to the specified OutputFile.":55,"Indicates that the plugin should generate translations without variables when using substitutions.":56,"Indicates that the plugin should generate partial translations to support text translations as it is \"scrolling in\".":57,"Indicates the plugin should parse 'TARC' directives and scope translations based on these.":58,"Indicates the plugin should not print out success messages in relation to translations.":59,"Blacklisted IMGUI Plugins":60,"If an IMGUI window assembly/class/method name contains any of the strings in this list (case insensitive) that UI will not be translated. Requires MonoMod hooks. This is a list seperated by ';'":61,"Indicates if texts that are considered by the plugin to be untranslatable should be output to the specified OutputFile.":62,"Indicates that rules for virtual method calls should be ignored when trying to set the text of a text component. May in some cases help setting the text of stubborn components.":63,"Max Text Parser Recursion":64,"Indicates how many levels of recursion are allowed when text is parsed so it can be translated in different parts. This can be used with splitter-regexes in advanced scenarios. The default value of one essentially means that recursion is disabled.":65,"Will preprocess and decode html entities before they are send for translation. Some translators will fail when html entities are sent.":66,"Will enable automated handling of rich text (text with markup).":67,"Indicates if translator-related helpful log messages should be enabled. May be useful when tranlating based on redirected resources.":68,"Indicates that the plugin must use MonoMod hooks instead of harmony hooks.":69,"Indicates the plugin should initial harmony detour bridge which allows harmony hooks to work in an environment where System.Reflection.Emit does not exist (usually such settings are handled by plugin managers, so don't use when using a plugin manager).":70,"Redirected Resource Detection Strategy":71,"Indicates if and how the plugin should attempt to recognize redirected resources in order to prevent double translations.":72,"Indicates if the plugin should output text that exceeds <b>'Max Characters Per Translation'</b> without translating it.":73,"Texture":74,"Texture Directory":75,"Directory to dump textures to, and root of directories to load images from. Can use placeholder: {GameExeName}, {Lang}":76,"Indicates whether the plugin will attempt to replace in-game images with those from the TextureDirectory directory.":77,"Indicates whether the plugin will dump texture it is capable of replacing to the TextureDirectory. Has significant performance impact.":78,"Indicates whether or not toggling the translation with the ALT+T hotkey will also affect textures. Not guaranteed to work for all textures. Has significant performance impact.":79,"Indicates whether or not the plugin should scan for textures on scene load. This enables the plugin to find and (possibly) replace more texture.":80,"Indicates whether or not the plugin should attempt to hook SpriteRenderer. This is a seperate option because SpriteRenderer can't actually be hooked properly and the implemented workaround could have a theoretical impact on performance in certain situations.":81,"Indicates whether or not unmodified textures should be loaded. Modifications are determined based on the hash in the file name. Only enable this for debugging purposes as it is likely to cause oddities.":82,"Texture Hash Generation Strategy":83,"Indicates how the mod identifies pictures through hashes.":84,"Duplicate Texture Names":85,"Indicates specific texture names that are duplicated in the game. List is separated by ';'":86,"Indicates if the plugin should detect duplicate texture names.":87,"Indicates the plugin should use a different strategy to load images, that may be relevant if the game engine is old.":88,"Indicates that all textures loaded should be kept in memory for optimal performance. Disable to decrease memory usage.":89,"Resource Redirector":90,"Preferred Storage Path":91,"Indicates the preferred storage for redirected resources in relation to the Auto Translator. Can use placeholder: {GameExeName}, {Lang}":92,"Indicates if TextAssets should be redirected":93,"Indicates if the plugin should log to the console all loaded assets. Useful to determine what can be hooked":94,"Indicates if translatable resources that are found should be dumped":95,"When files are in ZIP files in the PreferredStoragePath, these files are indexed in memory to avoid performing file check IO when loading them. Enabling this option will do the same for physical files":96,"HTTP":97,"User Agent":98,"Override the user agent used by APIs requiring a user agent":99,"Indiciates whether certificate validations for the .NET API should be disabled":100,"Translation Aggregator":101,"Width":102,"The total width of the translation aggregator window":103,"Height":104,"The width (per translator) of the translation aggregator window.":105,"Enabled Translators":106,"The id's of the translation endpoints that has been enabled in the translation aggregator window. List is separated by ';'":107,"Google":108,"ServiceUrl":109,"OPTIONAL, can be used to direct google API request to a different URL. Can be used to circumvent GFWoC":110,"Google Legitimate":111,"Google API Key":112,"OPTIONAL, needed if GoogleTranslateLegitimate is configured":113,"Bing Legitimate":114,"OcpApim Subscription Key":115,"OPTIONAL, needed if BingTranslateLegitimate is configured":116,"Baidu":117,"Baidu App Id":118,"OPTIONAL, needed if BaiduTranslate is configured":119,"BaiduAppSecret":120,"Yandex":121,"Yandex API Key":122,"OPTIONAL, needed if YandexTranslate is configured":123,"Watson":124,"Url":125,"OPTIONAL, needed if WatsonTranslate is configured":126,"Key":127,"DeepL":128,"MinDelay":129,"OPTIONAL, used for throttling DeepL":130,"MaxDelay":131,"DeepL Legitimate":132,"OPTIONAL, required if DeepLLegitimate is configured":133,"Custom":134,"Optional, needed if Custom Translated is configured":135,"Lec Power Translator 15":136,"InstallationPath":137,"Optional, needed if Lec Power Translator 15 is configured":138,"Debug":139,"Enables the console. Do not enable if other plugins (managers) handles this":140,"Enables extra logging for debugging purposes":141,"ezTrans":142,"Installation Path of ezTrans.":143,"Migrations":144,"Used to enable automatic migrations of this configuration file":145,"Tag":146,"Tag representing the last version this plugin was executed under. Do not edit":147},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/unityTrans/configEdit.html","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":148,"length":148,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/unityTrans/unityTrans.js":{"data":[["XUnity Translator is needed to perform this action\nPlease install it through Third Party Application Installer!","需要 XUnity Translator 才能執行此操作\n請透過第三方應用程式安裝器安裝！"],["XUnity.AutoTranslator is found!","找到 XUnity.AutoTranslator！"],["Translator++ detects that XUnity.AutoTranslator is already installed. Translator++ will use existing translation data to start a new translation project.","Translator++ 檢測到 XUnity.AutoTranslator 已安裝。Translator++ 將使用現有翻譯資料來啟動新翻譯專案。"],["XUnity.AutoTranslator is not found!","未找到 XUnity.AutoTranslator！"],["The wizard will guide you to install XUnity.AutoTranslator into the game.","精靈將引導您將 XUnity.AutoTranslator 安裝到遊戲中。"],["Next","下一步"],["Given path: ","給定路徑："],["\nis not an Unity game. Do you still want to proceed?","\n不是Unity遊戲。您仍要繼續嗎？"],["Patch successfully installed!\r\n","修補程式已成功安裝！\r\n"],["The configuration will be generated when you play the game for the first time.\r\n","配置將在您首次遊玩遊戲時生成。\r\n"],["Open the game now?","現在打開遊戲嗎？"],["Finish","完成"],["Update current project?","更新當前專案嗎？"]],"context":[["tid/432/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7224/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7270/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7287/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7352/type/StringLiteral","tid/7929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7437/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7441/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7606/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7613/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7620/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7730/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8938/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"unityTrans.js","dirname":"/addons/unityTrans","extension":".js","filename":"unityTrans.js","path":"/addons/unityTrans/unityTrans.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"XUnity Translator is needed to perform this action\nPlease install it through Third Party Application Installer!":0,"XUnity.AutoTranslator is found!":1,"Translator++ detects that XUnity.AutoTranslator is already installed. Translator++ will use existing translation data to start a new translation project.":2,"XUnity.AutoTranslator is not found!":3,"The wizard will guide you to install XUnity.AutoTranslator into the game.":4,"Next":5,"Given path: ":6,"\nis not an Unity game. Do you still want to proceed?":7,"Patch successfully installed!\r\n":8,"The configuration will be generated when you play the game for the first time.\r\n":9,"Open the game now?":10,"Finish":11,"Update current project?":12},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/unityTrans/unityTrans.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":13,"length":13,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/wolfJs/wolfJs.js":{"data":[["Maximum number of line in message box.","訊息框中的最大行數。"],["Default value is 4. Type 0 to disable this feature. If the number of line in message box is greater than this number, Translator++ will generates a new message box to prevents the texts overflowing the boxes.","預設值為4。輸入0以停用此功能。如果訊息框中的行數超過此數字，Translator++將生成新的訊息框以防止文字溢出。"],["Use shell copy if possible","如果可能，使用shell複製"],["Use shell copy instead of native NodeJS copy handler.","使用shell複製而非原生NodeJS複製處理器。"],["Use shell copy","使用shell複製"],["WRPGE Editor is not installed\r\nPlease install it from T++ menu > Third party application installer\r\n\r\nOpen Third Party application installer now?","WRPGE編輯器未安裝\r\n請從T++選單 > 第三方應用程式安裝器安裝\r\n\r\n現在打開第三方應用程式安裝器嗎？"],["Unable to determina WRPGE path.","無法確定WRPGE路徑。"],["Translator++ is about to install WRPGE editor in the destination folder.\r\nContinue?","Translator++即將在目標資料夾中安裝WRPGE編輯器。\r\n繼續嗎？"],["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","開發路徑未定義。\n您應注入遊戲一次以生成開發路徑。"],["Translate a Wolf RPG game up to ver. 3.330 with WolfJs library. The default Wolf RPG parser for Translator++.","使用WolfJs庫翻譯Wolf RPG遊戲至版本3.330。Translator++的預設Wolf RPG解析器。"],["Wolf RPG Editor games","Wolf RPG編輯器遊戲"],["Parsing Wolf RPG Game with","正在使用解析Wolf RPG遊戲"],["Wolf RPG Editor game","Wolf RPG編輯器遊戲"],["Select the game's executable file","選擇遊戲的可執行檔案"],["Engine version","引擎版本"],["Detected WolfRPG Engine version of the selected game","偵測到所選遊戲的 WolfRPG 引擎版本"],["Heads up!\r\n","注意！\r\n"],["\r\ndoesn't seem to be a Wolf RPG executable file!\r\nAre you sure want to start Wolf RPG Project from this entry point?","\r\n似乎不是 Wolf RPG 可執行檔案！\r\n您確定要從此入口點開始 Wolf RPG 專案嗎？"],["Create a new project","建立新專案"],["Please specify a game to be processed!","請指定要處理的遊戲！"],["Set dev path. Path to the directory of the translated game.","設定開發路徑。指向已翻譯遊戲的目錄路徑。"],["Play last build","播放最後建置"],["Open editor","開啟編輯器"],["Open Wolf RPG Editor online manual","開啟 Wolf RPG 編輯器線上手冊"],["Open Wolf RPG Editor english manual","開啟 Wolf RPG 編輯器英文手冊"],["Can not find the manual file.\nPlease install Wolf RPG Editor through 3rd Party app installer.","找不到手冊檔案。\n請透過第三方應用程式安裝程式安裝 Wolf RPG 編輯器。"]],"context":[["tid/99/type/StringLiteral","tid/12843/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/109/type/StringLiteral","tid/12853/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/486/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/496/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/513/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7571/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7851/type/StringLiteral","tid/12443/type/StringLiteral","tid/12542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10368/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10411/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10416/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10429/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10447/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10452/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10752/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10759/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11124/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11221/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12334/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12394/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12493/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12592/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12650/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12697/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"wolfJs.js","dirname":"/addons/wolfJs","extension":".js","filename":"wolfJs.js","path":"/addons/wolfJs/wolfJs.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Maximum number of line in message box.":0,"Default value is 4. Type 0 to disable this feature. If the number of line in message box is greater than this number, Translator++ will generates a new message box to prevents the texts overflowing the boxes.":1,"Use shell copy if possible":2,"Use shell copy instead of native NodeJS copy handler.":3,"Use shell copy":4,"WRPGE Editor is not installed\r\nPlease install it from T++ menu > Third party application installer\r\n\r\nOpen Third Party application installer now?":5,"Unable to determina WRPGE path.":6,"Translator++ is about to install WRPGE editor in the destination folder.\r\nContinue?":7,"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":8,"Translate a Wolf RPG game up to ver. 3.330 with WolfJs library. The default Wolf RPG parser for Translator++.":9,"Wolf RPG Editor games":10,"Parsing Wolf RPG Game with":11,"Wolf RPG Editor game":12,"Select the game's executable file":13,"Engine version":14,"Detected WolfRPG Engine version of the selected game":15,"Heads up!\r\n":16,"\r\ndoesn't seem to be a Wolf RPG executable file!\r\nAre you sure want to start Wolf RPG Project from this entry point?":17,"Create a new project":18,"Please specify a game to be processed!":19,"Set dev path. Path to the directory of the translated game.":20,"Play last build":21,"Open editor":22,"Open Wolf RPG Editor online manual":23,"Open Wolf RPG Editor english manual":24,"Can not find the manual file.\nPlease install Wolf RPG Editor through 3rd Party app installer.":25},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/wolfJs/wolfJs.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":26,"length":26,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/xmlTrans/xml.js":{"data":[["Start translation from XML-like documents. Supports both XML and HTML format.","從類似 XML 的文件開始翻譯。支援 XML 和 HTML 格式。"],["Create project","建立專案"]],"context":[["tid/795/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/864/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"xml.js","dirname":"/addons/xmlTrans","extension":".js","filename":"xml.js","path":"/addons/xmlTrans/xml.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Start translation from XML-like documents. Supports both XML and HTML format.":0,"Create project":1},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/xmlTrans/xml.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":2,"length":2,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/yurisParser/YurisParser.js":{"data":[["YU-RIS engine translator","YU-RIS 引擎翻譯器"],["Checking up requirements...","正在檢查需求..."],["Create a new translation project from YU-RIS visual novel engine","從 YU-RIS 視覺小說引擎建立新的翻譯專案"],["Next","下一步"],["Select YU-RIS game","選擇 YU-RIS 遊戲"],["Select the game's executable file","選擇遊戲的可執行檔案"],["Engine version","引擎版本"],["Detected YU-RIS version of the selected game","檢測到所選遊戲的YU-RIS版本"],["Create a new project","建立新專案"],["Invalid target game :","無效的目標遊戲："],["Source material do not match the current translation project!","原始素材與當前翻譯專案不符！"],["Select the repack method.","選擇重新封裝方法。"],["<ul><li><b>Repack into original YPF file(s)</b><br />Will repack the translation to the original pack. May take longer time to extract the original pack, patch it with translation and repack it again.</li>","<ul><li><b>重新封裝到原始的YPF檔案中</b><br />將翻譯重新封裝到原始封裝中。可能需要較長時間來提取原始封裝、套用翻譯並重新封裝。</li>"],["<li><b>Repack as a YPF patch file</b><br>Will repack the translation as a separate patch file (e.g. update9.ypf). This way, it is possible to translate the game even without modifying the original ypf files. Combine this with Copy material's <b>Do not copy material, inject translation only</b> option for the faster patching process.</li></ul>","<li><b>重新封裝為YPF補丁檔案</b><br>將翻譯重新封裝為獨立的補丁檔案（例如update9.ypf）。這樣，即使不修改原始的ypf檔案，也能翻譯遊戲。結合複製素材的<b>不複製素材，僅注入翻譯</b>選項，可實現更快的補丁處理。</li></ul>"],["The target repack version must match your game version. Enter the major and minor version separated by a dot. For example: <b>0.466</b>. By default, Translator++ will detect the engine version when you create the project.","目標重新封裝版本必須與您的遊戲版本匹配。請輸入以點分隔的主要和次要版本。例如：<b>0.466</b>。預設情況下，Translator++會在建立專案時檢測引擎版本。"]],"context":[["tid/4757/type/StringLiteral","tid/4811/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4770/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4816/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4995/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5081/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5086/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5099/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5104/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5440/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5501/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6557/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6561/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6613/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"YurisParser.js","dirname":"/addons/yurisParser","extension":".js","filename":"YurisParser.js","path":"/addons/yurisParser/YurisParser.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"YU-RIS engine translator":0,"Checking up requirements...":1,"Create a new translation project from YU-RIS visual novel engine":2,"Next":3,"Select YU-RIS game":4,"Select the game's executable file":5,"Engine version":6,"Detected YU-RIS version of the selected game":7,"Create a new project":8,"Invalid target game :":9,"Source material do not match the current translation project!":10,"Select the repack method.":11,"<ul><li><b>Repack into original YPF file(s)</b><br />Will repack the translation to the original pack. May take longer time to extract the original pack, patch it with translation and repack it again.</li>":12,"<li><b>Repack as a YPF patch file</b><br>Will repack the translation as a separate patch file (e.g. update9.ypf). This way, it is possible to translate the game even without modifying the original ypf files. Combine this with Copy material's <b>Do not copy material, inject translation only</b> option for the faster patching process.</li></ul>":13,"The target repack version must match your game version. Enter the major and minor version separated by a dot. For example: <b>0.466</b>. By default, Translator++ will detect the engine version when you create the project.":14},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/yurisParser/YurisParser.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":15,"length":15,"percent":100},"parameter