xisting files will be overwritten!","現有文件將被覆蓋！"],["Process","處理"],["Path to the directory can not be empty!","目錄路徑不能為空！"],["Invalid directory:","無效目錄："],["Rebuild translation table from this cache","從此緩存重建翻譯表"],["Create new project","創建新項目"],["-nothing-","-無-"],["Ok","確定"],["No action selected, are you sure?","未選擇任何操作，確定嗎？"],["No context's keyword specified!","未指定上下文關鍵字！"],["Remove context containing keyword :\n","移除包含關鍵字的上下文：\n"],["\nfrom selected files?","\n從選定檔案中？"],["Remove every rows except rows that has a context containing keyword :\n","移除所有行，除了包含關鍵字的上下文行：\n"],["items","項目"],["Select Context","選擇上下文"],["Manual Query","手動查詢"],["Tag filter","標籤過濾器"],["Merging option","合併選項"],["Source Column","來源欄"],["Target Column","目標欄"],["Maximum length","最大長度"],["Query","查詢"],["Select how you want to filter the rows to be wrapped based on their context.","選擇如何根據上下文過濾要包裝的行。"],["Your list of context separated by new line","您的上下文列表（以換行分隔）"],["Optionally filter rows by their color tags.","可選地按顏色標籤過濾行。"],["Options","選項"],["No merging","不合并"],["Merge lines","合併行"],["Merge lines except first line","合併行（除第一行外）"],["General setup","一般設定"],["Wrap text","換行文字"],["Source & target column can not be same!","來源與目標欄位不能相同！"],["No files are selected on file selector pane.\nTranslator++ will assume that all files will be processed\nAre you sure with this?","檔案選擇面板中沒有選取任何檔案。\nTranslator++ 將假設所有檔案都會被處理\n您確定要這樣做嗎？"],["One or more required options are not set for ","一個或多個必要選項未設定給 "],["One or more settings required by the translator engine are not set. If you continue, the translation process may fail.","翻譯引擎所需的一個或多個設定未設定。如果繼續，翻譯過程可能會失敗。"],["Required options :","必要選項："],["Open the settings","開啟設定"],["Continue anyway","無論如何繼續"],["Translate Now","立即翻譯"],["Please select translator engine","請選擇翻譯引擎"],["Can not process your request because the source column and target column are same!","無法處理您的請求，因為來源欄位和目標欄位相同！"],["Tags","標籤"],["Merge Option","合併選項"],["Add rows","新增行"],["None","無"],["Merge","合併"],["Merge except the first line","合併除第一行外"],["No export path specified","未指定匯出路徑"],["Export path can not be inside or the same with the project folder.\nYour export path: ","匯出路徑不能位於或與專案資料夾相同。\n您的匯出路徑："],["\nYour project path: ","\n您的專案路徑："],["\n\nPlease choose another folder!","\n\n請選擇另一個資料夾！"],["Export Now","立即匯出"],["Action","動作"],["Append tags","附加標籤"],["Remove tags","移除標籤"],["Set tags","設定標籤"],["Do nothing","不執行任何操作"],["-unknown title-","-未知標題-"],["Can not open file. File not exist.","無法開啟檔案。檔案不存在。"],["Go to online documentation.","前往線上文件。"],["No projects yet","尚無專案"],["Are you new to Translator++?<br />\n\t\t\tPlease read our online documentation at <b>dreamsavior.net</b>.<br />\n\t\t\tPress <b>F1</b> to open online help.<br />\n\t\t\tContact me at <b>patreon.com/dreamsavior</b> for question and bug reports.\n\t\t\t","您是 Translator++ 的新手嗎？<br />\n\t\t\t請閱讀我們的線上文件，網址為 <b>dreamsavior.net</b>。<br />\n\t\t\t按 <b>F1</b> 開啟線上說明。<br />\n\t\t\t如有問題或錯誤報告，請在 <b>patreon.com/dreamsavior</b> 聯繫我。\n\t\t\t"],["Warning","警告"],["Close","關閉"],["You are about to run a user script!","您即將執行使用者腳本！"],["Execute the script","執行腳本"],["Bring to main screen","帶到主畫面"],["Show row header info","顯示列標頭資訊"],["Row header width","列標頭寬度"],["Display marker on organic cells","在有機儲存格上顯示標記"],["Leave trail on cell visit","在訪問單元格時留下軌跡"],["Display trails on visited cells","在已訪問的單元格上顯示軌跡"],["Row Properties","行屬性"],["Project Properties","專案屬性"],["Project Properties : ","專案屬性："],["Stage path do not exist!","舞台路徑不存在！"],["Select dev folder","選擇開發資料夾"],["Where is the translated game's directory located at?<br />This is the same folder with the destination directory when injecting your game.","翻譯遊戲的目錄位於何處？<br />這與注入遊戲時的目的地目錄是同一個資料夾。"],["Select folder","選擇資料夾"],["Submit","提交"],["File Properties","檔案屬性"],["File Properties : ","檔案屬性："],["Target column","目標欄位"],["Trim Whitespaces","修剪空白"],["Please select a column","請選擇一個欄位"],["Are you sure want to trim the whitespaces on selected column?\nThis action can not be undone!","您確定要修剪所選欄位中的空白嗎？\n此操作無法撤銷！"],["Are you sure want commit autopadding on selected column?\nThis action can not be undone!","您確定要對所選欄位執行自動填充嗎？\n此操作無法撤銷！"],["Markers","標記"],["Markers are visual guidelines for the number of characters in a line.","標記是視覺指南，用於指示一行中的字符數量。"],["The marker will only be visible if wordwrap in the text area is disabled.","只有在文字區域中禁用自動換行時，標記才會可見。"],["Add","新增"],["Clear all","清除全部"],["Enable suggestion","啟用建議"],["Speech Synthesizer","語音合成器"],["Reading speed:","朗讀速度："],["Pitch:","音高："],["Volume:","音量："],["Mark at","標記於"],["Units","單位"],["Half width character (ie. Alphabet, etc)","半形字元（例如：字母等）"],["Full width character (ie. Hiragana, Kanji, 漢字, etc)","全形字元（例如：平假名、漢字等）"],["Color","顏色"],["Remove","移除"],["Current Cell's Editor Options","目前儲存格的編輯器選項"],["Auto Padding","自動填充"],["Create","建立"],["Unable to open that file!","無法開啟該檔案！"],["Are you sure want to close the project?\nYou will lost any unsaved changes!","確定要關閉專案嗎？\n您將遺失任何未儲存的變更！"],["Are you sure want to exit Translator++?\nYou will lost any unsaved changes!","確定要退出 Translator++ 嗎？\n您將遺失任何未儲存的變更！"],["Do not show this message again!","不再顯示此訊息！"],["Back","返回"],["Are you sure want to execute the following script?","您確定要執行以下腳本嗎？"],["No script found","未找到腳本"],["Open Script Editor","開啟腳本編輯器"],["How to add Automation here","如何在此處添加自動化"],["Clear Quick Launch","清除快速啟動"],["Are you sure want to clear all quick launch scripts?","您確定要清除所有快速啟動腳本嗎？"],["Remove selected objects?","移除選取的物件？"],["Do you wish to remove related staging files too?\nWarning: This is can not be undone!","您是否也希望移除相關的暫存檔案？\n警告：此操作無法復原！"],["Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ","錯誤！\r\nTranslator++ 無法檢測到 "],["`Required application to parse ${","`解析 ${"],["} is not installed.\\nPlease install it through Third party application installer.\\nDo you want to open Third Party Application Installer window?`","} 所需的應用程式未安裝。\\n請透過第三方應用程式安裝器安裝。\\n您要開啟第三方應用程式安裝器視窗嗎？`"],["The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package