inside this folder.\"></i>":38,"<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.":39,"Translated Material Location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"The location of the game that has been translated. The default location of the translation injection.\"></i>":40,"Translator <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Prefered translator for this project. If not defined, global setting will be used.\"></i>":41,"Translate From":42,"Translate Into":43,"Staging Path <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Staging path is the location of some files required to export/build translations. Staging files generated when you created the project.\"></i>":44,"Objects <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Number of objects/files available on the left pane\"></i>":45,"Folders":46,"Characters <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Number of characters in the Original Text column\"></i>":47,"Words <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"May display wrong value in languages that doesn't use spaces (ie. Japanese, Chinese).\"></i>":48,"Total Rows":49,"Translated row":50,"Organic translation <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Users filled directly into the grid. Which is a good sign. Can be human translation, can be edited MTL, etc.\"></i>":51,"&nbsp;":52,"Overall progress <span class=\"percentDisplay\" data-field=\"percent\"></span>%":53,"On after export<i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Run a javascript function after this project is successfully exported.\"></i>":54,"Display this information when the project is opened.":55,"Select Export Mode":56,"Export to a folder":57,"Export pre-compiled game data to a folder<br>Folder structures are retained":58,"Export as a Zip file":59,"Export pre-compiled game data to a single zipped archive":60,"RPGMakerTrans Patch Files":61,"Export to RPGMakerTrans formatted *.txt files in a folder":62,"Comma Separated Values":63,"Export to Comma Separated Values (csv) files in a folder":64,"Office Open XML (.xlsx) Excel 2007 and above":65,"Export to Microsoft Excel Spreadsheet (xlsx) files in a folder":66,"BIFF 8 (.xls) Excel 97 and above":67,"Export to Microsoft Excel Spreadsheet (xls) files in a folder":68,"HTML Spreadsheet":69,"Export to HTML files in a folder":70,"Open Document Format/OASIS (.ods)":71,"Export to ODS files in a folder":72,"Select Import Mode":73,"Import translation from another .trans file":74,"Open another Translator++ file<br>Apply translation into current project.":75,"Import translation from spreadsheets":76,"Import translation from various spreadsheets file<br>(.xls, .xlsx, .ods, .html, .xml, etc)":77,"Import translation from RPGMakerTrans Patch format":78,"Import translation from RPGMaker Trans' patch files<br>(.txt)":79,"Source :":80,"Select objects to import":81,"Import mode :":82,"Import translations":83,"Import data object":84,"Destination :":85,"Currently selected : ":86,"Options :":87,"Import the context translations":88,"Case insensitive":89,"Overwrite target":90,"Destination column : ":91,"Translation mode :":92,"Row by row translation":93,"Line by line translation":94,"Select translation by context address":95,"Just copy translation into the same row (No checking)":96,"Merge data":97,"Import translation from spreadsheet into project":98,"Import translation from any spreadsheet format (xls, xlsx, odx, html, csv, etc).":99,"<b>The spreadsheet must have at least 2 columns.</b> The most important column is the first column (the leftmost column) containing the original texts. The following columns contain the translations. Translator++ will use the text in the rightmost cell that is not empty.":100,"Please click the radio button to select files/folder to import":101,"Import file(s)":102,"Import folder":103,"Import translation from RPG Maker Trans into project":104,"<i class=\"icon-tpp\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">Select project type</span>":105,"Select project type":106,"Spreadsheet":107,"Start a translation project from spreadsheet data (xls, xlsx, ods, xml, html, sylk, gnumeric, csv)":108,"Blank project":109,"Create a new .trans file from scratch.":110,"<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">Spreadsheet</span>":111,"Fetch type":112,"The first columns are translatable text, the rest of the column are predefined translations (Create a grid data that matches the original table)":113,"All columns are translatable text":114,"Custom":115,"Custom Options":116,"Which column do you want to fetch?":117,"Please specify which column you want to fetch and which column you want to put the translation into. <b>It is 0 based index (the first column is 0)</b>.":118,"Column to be translated":119,"Column to put translation into":120,"Action":121,"Enable Row Header Text Column":122,"If enabled, the parser will process the following Row Header Text Column rule":123,"Row Header Text Column":124,"If specified, the value in this column will be applied to the row header. This is useful for determining the current speaker or actor, etc. It is a zero-based index.":125,"Options":126,"Calculate cell value":127,"Cell value in the form of formula will be transpiled":128,"Get formatted value":129,"Process cell values after formatting. (For example the integer 100000 in certain locale will become USD 100,000)":130,"Parse CSV in EXCEL format":131,"Force the parser to parse CSV in MS EXCEL way. (only for CSV files)":132,"Skip the first <i>n</i> row(s)":133,"Use this option if you want to skip the row header.":134,"Select File(s)":135,"Select a directory":136,"<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">Create a new Trans file</span>":137,"Create a new Trans file":138,"The title of this project":139,"Engine type":140,"Type of the engine":141,"<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">Placeholder for something great at the near future!</span>":142,"Placeholder for something great at the near future!":143,"This module will be created when the patron count reach 500!":144,"\n\t\tA project with the same title <br>\"<span class=\"dialogGameTitle\"></span>\"<br> is already exist on the post processed cache.<br>\n\t\tYou can re-use this cache to shorten loading time significantly.\n\t":145,"If you are confused, you can always safely click <strong><a href=\"#\">\"Create new project\"</a></strong> button. ":146,"Existed cache":147,"Select Translator":148,"Source column":149,"Which column is the source text to translate for?<br>(default is key column / leftmost column).":150,"Target column":151,"Which column is the translated text put into.<br>(Can not same with source column)":152,"Translator's Options":153,"Also try to translate other object":154,"If this option is checked then Translator++ will also try to translate other objects that you did not select that doesn't require machine translation. This is the default behavior in Translator++ version 2.3.23 or lower.":155,"Ignore if already translated":156,"If this option is checked then Translator++ will ignore any row that already has translations on its column.":157,"Overwrite cells":158,"Overwrite target cells. If not checked, the cells will not be touched when not empty.":159,"Save project on each batch.":160,"Save your project on each batch completion.<br>This option is to avoid data loss when the application crashes due to running heavy tasks from the local translator application. You probably don't need this if you're running cloud based translator.":161,"Play sound when completed.":162,"Tags":163,"Select Context(s)":164,"Manual Query":165,"Match all words":166,"Remove selected":167,"Remove all but selected":168,"Select Context":169,"Source Column":170,"Target Column":171,"Maximum length":172,"Export into":173,"What to do with tagged rows?":174,"Select Color Tag":175,"On the fly word wrap":176,"Inject all files (ignoring selection)":177,"You're about to inject translation via <b>Inject all</b> button. This will inject translation regardless your selected object on the left pane. Use left pane's context menu if you want to inject selected object.":178,"Select the source material to be translated":179,"\n\t\t\t\tSelect the specific material or content you wish to translate, such as a file, directory, or other relevant input. Make sure the chosen material is accessible and appropriately formatted for the corresponding parser.<br>\n\t\t\t\tBy default, some parsers use the staging directory as the source material.\n\t\t\t":180,"Path is inaccessible.":181,"Target Directory":182,"\n\t\t\t\tA copy of your translated application will be generated in this folder.\n\t\t\t":183,"Field can not be empty!":184,"Target to apply translation":185,"\n\t\t\t\tPlease select executable file.\n\t\t\t":186,"Copy materials":187,"The copying options from Source Material to Target Directory. (experimental, not all engines are supported)":188,"Word Wrap by Tags":189,"Directory name":190,"\n\t\t\t\tThe object will be grouped under this directory.<br>\n\t\t\t\tEnter star \"<code>*</code>\" to add a new <b>reference object</b>.\n\t\t\t":191,"Invalid directory  name":192,"Object name":193,"\n\t\t\t\tThe name of the object.\n\t\t\t":194,"Invalid object name":195,"New Project":196,"Save":197,"Save as...":198,"Open...":199,"Recent":200,"None...":201,"Export Project":202,"To a folder":203,"As a zip file":204,"To portable .tpp file":205,"To RPGMakerTrans file (*.txt)":206,"To CSV file":207,"To XLSX file":208,"To XLS file":209,"To ODS file":210,"To HTML file":211,"Import":212,"Project from .tpp file":213,"Translation from .trans file":214,"Translation Spreadsheet":215,"Translation RPGMKTRANSPATCH Format":216,"Automation":217,"Batch translation":218,"Context tool":219,"Batch word wrapping":220,"Trim":221,"Auto padding":222,"Tools":223,"Third Party Application Installer":224,"Close project":225,"Exit":226,"Start here":227,"Start a New Project":228,"Continue your work":229,"Open Project":230,"Your recent translation":231,"Tips for you":232,"Next tip! <span class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></span>":233,"The rightmost cell in a row will get the priority.":234,"You can't share your project with others with just a trans file. You need to generate a TPP file.":235,"Always make backups of your trans files.":236,"You can rename and reorder the column with the coulumn header's context menu.":237,"Always backup your game before working with Translator++!":238,"If you encountered a feature that is not running normally, try restarting Translator++, it will fix the problem in the most cases.":239,"Always create a backup of your game before patching with a translation.":240,"Thank you for supporting Translator++.":241,"Please check Translator++'s online documentation at":242,"working":243,"Open":244,"Save file":245,"Save As":246,"Import Project":247,"Inject / apply all translation":248,"Execute Global Level Custom Script":249,"Toggle Active Cell Info":250,"Project Properties":251,"Get Help (F1)":252,"Batch translation (crl+b)":253,"File list":254,"Live Translation Pane":255,"Toggle selection":256,"Invert selection":257,"Add A New Object":258,"Connect to auto translator":259,"Undock pane":260,"Collapse / restore left panel":261,"Add new key (alt+n)":262,"Import Here":263,"Add a note to this file":264,"Open search menu":265,"Toggle grid information":266,"Object Properties":267,"Automatically set selected original text to clipboard":268,"Resize Font":269,"Toggle word wrapping & Explicit white spaces":270,"Use Monospace font":271,"Remove all translation from this file":272,"Remove this file from project":273,"file path":274,"Quick find":275,"Active cell's info":276,"View original untranslated text":277,"View raw data":278,"View row properties":279,"Go to current cell":280,"Current coordinate":281,"Word wraping (for non Japanese text)":282,"Speak original text (alt+,)"